L["Daggers for leveling through dungeons: in a group you stand behind the mob, so Backstab works. Improved Eviscerate, Puncturing Wounds (Backstab crits and extra combo points) and Opportunity first, then Malice, Murder (many dungeon mobs are humanoid), Ruthlessness and Relentless Strikes, then Combat for Dual Wield Specialization, Blade Flurry for packs and Adrenaline Rush. Open with Ambush, Backstab to build, Eviscerate to finish; Blade Flurry when the tank holds two or more."] = "在地城中練功的匕首配置：組隊時你站在怪物背後，所以背刺可用。先點強化剔骨、刺傷（背刺致命一擊並額外獲得連擊點數）和伺機而動，接著是惡意、謀殺（許多地城怪物是人型生物）、無情和無情打擊，然後點戰鬥系的雙武器專精、對付成群怪的劍刃亂舞和能量刺激。以伏擊開場，背刺累積連擊點數，剔骨收尾；坦克穩住兩隻以上時開劍刃亂舞。"
L["Decimation"] = "屠虐"
L["Demonic Brand"] = "惡魔烙印"
L["Demonology with Soul Link, played with a Voidwalker for the whole climb. Demonic Embrace, Fel Vitality and Demonic Aegis raise your health and armor early, Improved Voidwalker makes the pet a sturdier damage sponge, and Soul Link at 30 sends 30% of every hit you take to the pet. Keep Fear and your DoTs on the target, let the Voidwalker hold the enemy melee, and use Fel Domination to bring a pet back instantly if it dies mid-fight. Felhunter is the swap against casters (Spell Lock). After Soul Link you finish Demonology (Demonic Knowledge, Master Demonologist) and then fill Affliction for instant Corruption, Suppression, Curse of Exhaustion and Nightfall. You win by lasting longer than the other player, not by bursting them; expect slower kills than the Nightfall build. Soul Link requires a point in Demonic Sacrifice, but never use it: it removes the pet that Soul Link needs."] = "帶靈魂鏈結的惡魔學識，整個升級過程都搭配虛空行者。惡魔之擁、惡魔活力和惡魔庇護在早期提高你的生命值和護甲，強化虛空行者讓寵物成為更耐打的承傷者，30級的靈魂鏈結會把你受到的每次攻擊傷害的30%轉給寵物。讓目標保持恐懼術和你的持續傷害效果，讓虛空行者擋住敵人的近戰，如果寵物在戰鬥中死亡，就用惡魔支配立刻召回。面對施法者時換成惡魔獵犬（法術封鎖）。取得靈魂鏈結後先點完惡魔學識（惡魔知識、惡魔學識大師），再把剩餘點數補在痛苦系，取得瞬發腐蝕術、鎮壓、疲勞詛咒和夜幕。你靠比對手撐得更久來取勝，而不是靠爆發擊殺；擊殺速度會比夜幕配置慢。靈魂鏈結需要先點一點惡魔犧牲，但千萬別使用它：它會移除靈魂鏈結所需要的寵物。"
