L["Malevolence"] = "惡意"
L["Marksmanship first, then Survival for traps and survival. Improved Concussive Shot (a 20% chance to stun on every hit), Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim and Mortal Shots give you burst and a slow on anyone who closes in, and Scatter Shot at 30 is your panic button: scatter, walk away, shoot again. After that Deflection, Entrapment (your traps root whoever triggers them for 5 sec) and Deterrence at 41, then Surefooted against slows, Clever Traps for a longer Freezing Trap, Rapid Killing for a shorter Rapid Fire cooldown and Efficiency for mana. Trueshot Aura (Sniper Shot requires it) and Sniper Shot come last; Sniper Shot is a long cast, so use it on targets that cannot reach you. Open with Freezing Trap or Concussive Shot, keep your distance with Wing Clip and Disengage, and keep your pet on a short leash because it dies quickly against players. Beast Mastery wins for killing mobs, so this build is a PvP choice, not a leveling one."] = "先點射擊，再點生存系的陷阱和生存天賦。強化震盪射擊（每次命中有20%機率擊昏）、致命攻擊、仔細瞄準和致死射擊給你爆發，並減慢任何靠近你的敵人，30級的驅散射擊是你的保命按鈕：驅散，走開，再射擊。之後是偏斜、誘捕（你的陷阱會使觸發的人定身5秒）和41級的威懾，接著是穩固以對抗減速，靈巧陷阱讓冰凍陷阱持續更久，急速殺戮縮短急速射擊的冷卻時間，效率節省法力。強擊光環（狙擊需要它）和狙擊放在最後；狙擊的施法時間很長，所以要對無法接近你的目標使用。用冰凍陷阱或震盪射擊開場，用摔絆和逃脫保持距離，並讓寵物待在身邊不要跑遠，因為它在對上玩家時很快就會死。殺怪時野獸控制更勝一籌，所以這套配置是PvP選擇，不是練功選擇。"
