L["Shadow for fighting players, all the way from 10 to 60 (Discipline 11 / Shadow 40). Blackout gives every Shadow damage spell a chance to stun, Shadow Focus keeps your spells landing, and Improved Psychic Scream plus Mind Flay's slow give you room to run. Silence arrives at level 30 and is your answer to enemy healers and casters. Open with Shadow Word: Pain, Mind Flay anyone who runs, Psychic Scream when you are caught in melee, then finish with Mind Blast. Shadowform at 40 cuts physical damage taken by 15%; the Discipline points at the end add Power Word: Shield absorb and shorter Stun, Fear and Silence durations. Do not cast healing in Shadowform."] = "專為對戰玩家設計的暗影，從10級一路到60級（戒律11 / 暗影40）。昏厥讓每個暗影傷害法術都有機會擊昏目標，暗影集中讓你的法術不容易失手，強化心靈尖嘯加上精神鞭笞的減速給你逃跑的空間。沉默在30級取得，是你對付敵方治療者和施法者的手段。用暗言術：痛開場，對逃跑的人使用精神鞭笞，被近戰纏住時用心靈尖嘯，最後用心靈震爆收尾。40級的暗影形態使你受到的物理傷害降低15%；最後的戒律點數增加真言術：盾的吸收量，並縮短昏迷、恐懼和沉默的持續時間。在暗影形態下不要施放治療法術。"
L["Shadow for leveling through dungeons: Shadow Focus and Shadow Affinity first (less threat), then Mind Flay and Vampiric Embrace early so your Shadow damage heals the group, Shadow Weaving, Silence for casters, Shadowform at 40. Shadow Word: Pain on the kill target and anything the tank holds; let the tank build threat before Mind Blast."] = "在地城中練功的暗影配置：先點暗影集中和暗影親和（降低仇恨），接著盡早點精神鞭笞和吸血鬼的擁抱，讓你的暗影傷害治療隊伍，然後是暗影之波、對付施法者的沉默，40級點暗影形態。對擊殺目標和坦克穩住的所有怪上暗言術：痛；先讓坦克累積仇恨再用心靈震爆。"
L["Shadow priest tuned for solo questing: Spirit Tap and Shadow Focus first, wand to 28, then Mind Flay and Shadow Weaving; Vampiric Embrace self-heals, Improved Psychic Scream and Power Word: Shield cover a second mob. Shadowform at 40 (-15% physical, half-price Shadow mana), then Disc mana, Meditation and Soul Warding."] = "為單人解任務調整的暗影牧師：先點精神分流和暗影集中，28級前用魔杖，接著是精神鞭笞和暗影之波；吸血鬼的擁抱可自我治療，強化心靈尖嘯和真言術：盾能應付第二隻怪。40級點暗影形態（物理傷害-15%，暗影法術法力消耗減半），然後是戒律的法力天賦、冥想和靈魂結界。"
L["Shadow: Dungeon Leveling"] = "暗影：地城練功"
L["Shadow: Solo Leveling"] = "暗影：單人練功"
L["Shatter"] = "碎冰"
L["Shield-and-Seal-of-Fury leveler (Prot 41 / Ret 10): Consecration pack-pulls with near-zero rest from Shield Specialization and Improved Seal of Fury mana, Templar's Bulwark and Holy Shield as safety nets. Single-target kills are about a third slower than Retribution, but pulls of 2-3 mobs and an accidental add cost almost nothing."] = "盾牌加憤怒聖印的練功配置（防護41 / 懲戒10）：用奉獻拉成群的怪，盾牌專精和強化憤怒聖印的法力回復讓休息幾乎為零，聖殿騎士之壁壘和神聖之盾作為保命手段。單體擊殺比懲戒慢約三分之一，但拉2-3隻怪或意外多出一隻怪幾乎沒有代價。"
