L["Two-hander Arms for questing alone: the fastest way to level a Warrior in our model. Improved Rend first: keep Rend on every mob. Deflection and Improved Overpower by 20, Deep Wounds at 21-23, Improved Charge, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization and Impale by 30, Sweeping Strikes at 31, Bloodthrill from 32 (your hits on a bleeding target open Overpower), Weaponmaster from 40, Mortal Strike at 43, more Cruelty in the 40s, then Unbridled Wrath, Blood Craze and Improved Hamstring. Spend rage on Overpower first, then Mortal Strike and Slam; finish mobs with Execute."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器武器系配置：在我們的模型中是戰士練功最快的方式。先點強化撕裂：每隻怪都保持撕裂。20級前點偏斜和強化壓制，21-23級點重傷，30級前點強化衝鋒、雙手武器專精和穿刺，31級點橫掃攻擊，32級起點鮮血快感（你對流血目標的攻擊會觸發壓制），40級起點武器大師，43級點致死打擊，40多級再點殘忍，然後怒不可遏、血之狂熱和強化斷筋。怒氣優先用在壓制，然後致死打擊和猛擊；用斬殺收尾。"
L["Dual-wield Fury for questing alone, with two one-handers, about 4% slower than Arms in our model. Cruelty and Unbridled Wrath first for crit and rage, Furious Precision for off-hand hit, Blood Craze and Enrage in the mid 20s, Death Wish at 31, Dual Wield Specialization by 36, Flurry from 37, Gore Drinker at 40 and 42 with Bloodthirst at 41, then Improved Execute. Booming Voice and Lingering Rage at the end are free points: they don't speed up leveling."] = "單人解任務的雙持狂怒配置，使用兩把單手武器，在我們的模型中比武器慢約4%。先點殘忍和怒不可遏提高致命一擊和怒氣，狂暴精確提高副手命中，20多級中段點血之狂熱和狂怒，31級點死亡之願，36級前點雙武器專精，37級起點亂舞，40級和42級點 Gore Drinker，41級點嗜血，然後強化斬殺。最後的震耳嗓音和 Lingering Rage 是閒置點數：不會加快練功。"
L["Sword and board for questing alone: about 5% slower than Arms, but you take far less damage and rarely stop to eat. Shield Specialization and Improved Revenge first, Cruelty by 20, Improved Thunder Clap and Master of Defense in the early 20s, Anticipation with Vanguard (Charge in Defensive Stance) at 29, Last Stand at 33, Focused Rage, Concussion Blow at 38 (Shield Slam requires it), Bastion and Shield Slam at 44, then Unbridled Wrath, Blood Craze and Enrage from the Fury tree."] = "單人解任務的單手盾配置：比武器慢約5%，但承受的傷害少得多，很少需要停下來吃東西。先點盾牌專精和強化復仇，20級前點殘忍，20級出頭點強化雷霆一擊和防禦大師，29級點預知和守禦先鋒（防禦姿態下可衝鋒），33級點破釜沉舟，然後集中怒氣，38級點震盪猛擊（盾牌猛擊需要它），44級點堡壘和盾牌猛擊，然後點狂怒天賦樹的怒不可遏、血之狂熱和狂怒。"
L["Two-hander Arms for dungeons while leveling. Improved Rend and Cruelty first, then Improved Heroic Strike, Improved Overpower and Improved Charge by 21, Deep Wounds at 23-25 with Improved Tactical Mastery around it, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization and Impale from 28 to 32, Sweeping Strikes at 33 for packs, Bloodthrill in the mid 30s, Weaponmaster from 40, Mortal Strike at 46, then Unbridled Wrath in the 50s. On packs: Sweeping Strikes and Cleave; on bosses: Overpower, Mortal Strike and Execute."] = "練功期間打地城的雙手武器武器系配置。先點強化撕裂和殘忍，然後21級前點強化英勇打擊、強化壓制和強化衝鋒，23-25級點重傷，前後穿插強化戰術專精，28到32級點雙手武器專精和穿刺，33級點橫掃攻擊對付成群的怪，30多級中段點鮮血快感，40級起點武器大師，46級點致死打擊，然後50多級點怒不可遏。成群的怪：橫掃攻擊和順劈斬；首領：壓制、致死打擊和斬殺。"
L["Dual-wield Fury for dungeons while leveling. About 15% less damage than Arms: Dungeon Leveling in our model, so take it if you prefer two weapons. Cruelty and Unbridled Wrath first, Furious Precision and Dual Wield Specialization in the late 20s and 30s, Death Wish at 37, Flurry by 46, then Deep Wounds and Impale from Arms. No Bloodthirst: in groups those Arms talents add more. Cleave on packs, Heroic Strike with spare rage."] = "練功期間打地城的雙持狂怒配置。在我們的模型中傷害比武器：地城練功低約15%，喜歡雙武器再選它。先點殘忍和怒不可遏，20多級後段和30多級點狂暴精確和雙武器專精，37級點死亡之願，46級前點亂舞，然後點武器天賦樹的重傷和穿刺。不點嗜血：組隊時那些武器天賦收益更高。成群的怪用順劈斬，怒氣有餘就用英勇打擊。"
L["Sword and board tanking for dungeons while leveling. Shield Specialization and Improved Revenge first, Improved Thunder Clap and Master of Defense by 22, Last Stand at 23, Anticipation in the mid 20s, Concussion Blow at 30 (Shield Slam requires it), then Focused Rage, Bastion and Shield Slam at 40. After that the Arms tree: Deflection, Improved Tactical Mastery, Anger Management, Improved Charge, Improved Rend and Deep Wounds, with Cruelty as the last point at 60."] = "練功期間打地城的單手盾坦克配置。先點盾牌專精和強化復仇，22級前點強化雷霆一擊和防禦大師，23級點破釜沉舟，20多級中段點預知，30級點震盪猛擊（盾牌猛擊需要它），然後集中怒氣、堡壘，40級點盾牌猛擊。之後點武器天賦樹：偏斜、強化戰術專精、憤怒掌控、強化衝鋒、強化撕裂和重傷，60級最後一點給殘忍。"
L["Two-hander Retribution for questing alone. Benediction and Improved Judgement first, Holy Conduit and Seal of Command at 20, Pursuit of Justice (+15% run and mount speed), Sanctified Judgement and Sacred Arbiter in the 20s, Vengeance at 30, Champion of the Light by 37, then Divine Intellect, Improved Seals and Divine Strength from Holy and Twist of Light at 48. Open every pull with Judgement of the Crusader, then Seal of Command; from 25 add Consecration."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器懲戒配置。先點祈福和強化審判，20級點神聖導體和命令聖印，接著點正義追擊（跑速和坐騎速度+15%），20多級點聖化審判和神聖仲裁者，30級點復仇，37級前點光之勇士，然後點神聖系的神聖智慧、強化聖印和神聖之力，48級點聖光折射。每次開怪都先用十字軍審判，再上命令聖印；25級起加上奉獻。"
L["Two-hander Retribution for leveling through dungeons. Improved Judgement, Conviction and Seal of Command by 20, Vindication, Sacred Arbiter and Sanctified Judgement (Vengeance requires it) in the 20s, Vengeance at 30, then Holy: Divine Strength, Improved Seals, Healing Light, Purifying Power (Exorcism against the Undead), Illumination and Holy Shock, and Two-Handed Weapon Specialization, Repentance and Champion of the Light at the end. Open boss fights with Judgement of the Crusader and keep it up (about a fifth more damage); skip it on trash, where each mob dies before it pays back. Seal of Command, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown; Consecration once the tank holds the pack."] = "在地城中練功的雙手武器懲戒配置。20級前點強化審判、定罪和命令聖印，20多級點辯護、神聖仲裁者和聖化審判（復仇需要它），30級點復仇，然後點神聖系：神聖之力、強化聖印、治療之光、淨化能量（讓驅邪術可用於不死生物）、啟發和神聖震擊，最後點雙手武器專精、懺悔和光之勇士。首領戰以十字軍審判開場並持續維持（傷害約多五分之一）；小怪在它回本前就會死，不要使用。冷卻好就用命令聖印、審判和神聖打擊；坦克穩住整群怪後再用奉獻。"
L["Tanking groups through dungeons with a one-hander and shield. Redoubt first, then Precision so your attacks and seal procs land, Toughness, Improved Seal of Fury at 20 (more mana the higher the attacker's level), Shield Specialization, Improved Righteous Fury, Swift Judgement at 25 as an emergency taunt, One-Handed Weapon Specialization, Reckoning by 35, Templar's Bulwark and Sacred Duty in the mid 30s, Holy Shield at 40, then Benediction, Holy Conduit, Conviction, Improved Judgement and Iron Creed. Use Consecration from 20 to hold packs, keep Holy Shield up, and run Retribution Aura (its damage is much of your threat)."] = "使用單手武器加盾牌在地城中坦怪。先點盾牌壁壘，接著點精確讓你的攻擊和聖印觸發命中，堅韌，20級點強化憤怒聖印（攻擊者等級越高，回復的法力越多），然後是盾牌專精、強化正義之怒，25級點迅捷審判作為緊急嘲諷，單手武器專精，35級前點清算，30多級中段點聖殿騎士之壁壘和神聖職務，40級點神聖之盾，然後點祈福、神聖導體、定罪、強化審判和鐵之教條。從20級起用奉獻穩住成群的怪，保持神聖之盾，並開啟懲戒光環（它的傷害是你仇恨的一大來源）。"
L["Holy for questing alone while staying ready to heal a group. Divine Strength and Improved Seals from 10, then the Retribution damage talents (Benediction, Improved Judgement, Conviction, Seal of Command, Sanctified Judgement), alternating with Divine Intellect and Healing Light so Holy stays your main tree. Reverence and Illumination (it requires Reverence) in the 40s and Holy Shock at 47. Open every pull with Judgement of the Crusader, then Seal of Command; Holy Shock from the 50s. Slower than Retribution, as expected for a healer."] = "單人解任務的神聖配置，同時隨時能為隊伍治療。10級起點神聖之力和強化聖印，然後點懲戒系的傷害天賦（祈福、強化審判、定罪、命令聖印、聖化審判），與神聖智慧和治療之光交替點，讓神聖保持為主天賦樹。40多級點崇敬和啟發（它需要崇敬），47級點神聖震擊。每次開怪都先用十字軍審判，再上命令聖印；50多級起使用神聖震擊。比懲戒慢，以治療者來說在預期之內。"
L["Sword and board, pulling two or three mobs at a time: the fastest way to level a Paladin in our model. Redoubt first, then Precision and Toughness, Improved Seal of Fury at 20 for mana, Shield Specialization, One-Handed Weapon Specialization and Templar's Bulwark by 30, Reckoning by 35 and Holy Shield at 40, then Retribution: Deflection, Improved Judgement, Conviction, Holy Conduit and Pursuit of Justice. Seal of Fury, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, Consecration on packs. Pull one mob at a time below 20, two in the 20s and three from 35. Model-based: the simulator doesn't cover this play style."] = "劍盾配置，一次拉兩到三隻怪：在我們的模型中是聖騎士最快的練功方式。先點盾牌壁壘，接著點精確和堅韌，20級點強化憤怒聖印補充法力，30級前點盾牌專精、單手武器專精和聖殿騎士之壁壘，35級前點清算，40級點神聖之盾，然後點懲戒系：偏斜、強化審判、定罪、神聖導體和正義追擊。冷卻好就用憤怒聖印、審判和神聖打擊，成群的怪用奉獻。20級前一次拉一隻，20多級拉兩隻，35級起拉三隻。基於模型：模擬器不涵蓋這種玩法。"
L["Dual-wield Fury for dungeons while leveling, with two one-handers. Cruelty and Improved Rend first, Unbridled Wrath by 21, Furious Precision for off-hand hit, Dual Wield Specialization from 28, Death Wish at 32, Flurry from 37 to 41 and Bloodthirst at 42. Then the Arms tree: Improved Heroic Strike, Improved Charge, Deflection, Deep Wounds in the low 50s, with Impale and Improved Tactical Mastery last. Cleave on packs, Heroic Strike with spare rage."] = "練功期間打地城的雙持狂怒配置，使用兩把單手武器。先點殘忍和強化撕裂，21級前點怒不可遏，狂暴精確提高副手命中，28級起點雙武器專精，32級點死亡之願，37到41級點亂舞，42級點嗜血。然後點武器天賦樹：強化英勇打擊、強化衝鋒、偏斜，50級出頭點重傷，最後點穿刺和強化戰術專精。成群的怪用順劈斬，怒氣有餘就用英勇打擊。"
L["Balance: Solo Leveling"] = "平衡：單人練功"
L["Balance: Dungeon Leveling"] = "平衡：地城練功"
L["Restoration: Solo Leveling"] = "恢復：單人練功"
L["Feral for questing alone: Bear Form until 20, then Cat Form, tied with Balance as the fastest way to level a Druid in our model. Ferocity first, Feral Swiftness and Heart of the Wild in the teens, Sharpened Claws, Savage Fury and Thick Hide at 20-24, Predatory Strikes at 25-27, Blood Frenzy and Leader of the Pack by 30, then Balance in the 30s (Improved Wrath, Nature's Reach, Nature's Majesty), Natural Instinct at 40, Rend and Tear at 44-48 and Natural Reaction at 49-53. Claw to build combo points, Rake on every mob, Ferocious Bite or Rip to finish."] = "單人解任務的野性戰鬥配置：20級前用熊形態，之後用獵豹形態，在我們的模型中與平衡並列德魯伊練功最快的方式。先點兇暴，10多級點野性迅捷和野性之心，20-24級點鋒利獸爪、野蠻暴怒和厚皮，25-27級點猛獸攻擊，30級前點血之狂暴和獸群領袖，然後30多級點平衡系（強化憤怒、自然延伸、自然威嚴），40級點 Natural Instinct，44-48級點碎裂撕扯，49-53級點自然反應。用爪擊累積連擊點數，每隻怪都上掃擊，用兇猛撕咬或撕扯收尾。"
L["Balance caster for questing alone, tied with Feral as the fastest way to level a Druid in our model. Improved Wrath first, Moonglow and Nature's Reach in the teens, Improved Moonfire, Nature's Majesty and Nature's Splendor at 20-24, Vengeance at 25-29, Eclipse at 30, Genesis and Insect Swarm in the early 30s, Moonfury at 35-39, then Nature's Focus, Naturalist and Reflection from Restoration, Nature's Grace at 54, Subtlety and Heart of the Wild. No Improved Starfire or Moonkin Form in this version. Open with Moonfire, then Starfire; Wrath below 20."] = "單人解任務的平衡施法配置，在我們的模型中與野性並列德魯伊練功最快的方式。先點強化憤怒，10多級點月光和自然延伸，20-24級點強化月火術、自然威嚴和自然光采，25-29級點復仇，30級點蝕星蔽月，30級出頭點起源和蟲群，35-39級點月怒，然後點恢復系的自然集中、強化治療之觸和反射，54級點自然之賜，再點微妙和野性之心。這個版本不點強化星火術和梟獸形態。以月火術開場，接著用星火術；20級以下用憤怒。"
L["Restoration for questing alone while staying ready to heal a group, about 7% slower than the fastest Druid solo build in our model. Nature's Focus and Improved Wrath share the first ten points, Furor at 18, then Naturalist alternates with Nature's Reach and Moonglow up to 28, Reflection at 29-31, Improved Moonfire and Nature's Majesty, more Furor in the late 30s, Insect Swarm at 41, Vengeance and Subtlety in the 40s, and Living Spirit, Eclipse and Natural Shapeshifter in the 50s. Play it like Balance: Moonfire, then Starfire or Wrath, and heal yourself between pulls."] = "單人解任務的恢復配置，同時隨時能為隊伍治療，在我們的模型中比最快的德魯伊單人配置慢約7%。前十點由自然集中和強化憤怒平分，18級點激怒，然後到28級為止強化治療之觸與自然延伸、月光交替點，29-31級點反射，接著是強化月火術和自然威嚴，30多級後段再點激怒，41級點蟲群，40多級點復仇和微妙，50多級點活化精神、蝕星蔽月和自然變身。玩法和平衡一樣：月火術，然後星火術或憤怒，開怪之間治療自己。"
L["Feral Cat for dungeons while leveling: Claw (with Ferocity it does more per Energy than Shred), Rake and Rip. Heart of the Wild first, Ferocity by 19, Sharpened Claws and Shredding Attacks at 20-24, Shifting Power at 25 (it requires Shredding Attacks), Savage Fury and Predatory Strikes in the late 20s, Improved Shifting Power by 31, Leader of the Pack at 32, Blood Frenzy at 34 and 40, and Rend and Tear by 39. Then Balance for crit and hit (Genesis, Nature's Reach, Nature's Majesty), Nature's Focus and Naturalist from Restoration, and Natural Instinct at 60."] = "練功期間打地城的野性獵豹配置：爪擊（有兇暴時每點能量的效益比撕碎高）、掃擊和撕扯。先點野性之心，19級前點兇暴，20-24級點鋒利獸爪和撕碎攻擊，25級點 Shifting Power（它需要撕碎攻擊），20多級後段點野蠻暴怒和猛獸攻擊，31級前點 Improved Shifting Power，32級點獸群領袖，34級和40級點血之狂暴，39級前點碎裂撕扯。然後點平衡系提高爆擊和命中（起源、自然延伸、自然威嚴），恢復系的自然集中和強化治療之觸，60級點 Natural Instinct。"
L["Balance caster for dungeons while leveling. Improved Wrath first, Nature's Reach, Improved Moonfire and Nature's Majesty by 20, Genesis at 21, Moonglow at 22-24, Improved Starfire and Insect Swarm in the late 20s, Eclipse at 30-32, Vengeance at 33-34, Moonfury at 35-39, then Nature's Focus, Naturalist and Reflection from Restoration, the rest of Vengeance, Subtlety, Natural Shapeshifter and Moonkin Form at 60. Moonfire and Insect Swarm on bosses, Starfire to fill; from 40, Hurricane on packs once the tank holds them."] = "練功期間打地城的平衡施法配置。先點強化憤怒，20級前點自然延伸、強化月火術和自然威嚴，21級點起源，22-24級點月光，20多級後段點強化星火術和蟲群，30-32級點蝕星蔽月，33-34級點復仇，35-39級點月怒，然後點恢復系的自然集中、強化治療之觸和反射，再點完復仇，接著微妙、自然變身，60級點梟獸形態。首領身上保持月火術和蟲群，用星火術填補；40級起，坦克穩住整群怪後對它們施放颶風。"
L["Restoration for healing dungeons while leveling. Nature's Focus and Naturalist first, Reflection at 20-22 for mana while casting, Gift of Nature and Gift of the Earthmother in the 20s, Tranquil Spirit and Living Spirit in the 30s, Improved Rejuvenation by 39, then Genesis, Nature's Majesty and Moonglow from Balance in the 40s, Nature's Splendor at 50, Swiftmend at 51 and Nature's Swiftness at 53. Improved Wrath and Improved Regrowth take the last points. Keep Rejuvenation rolling on the tank, Regrowth when it drops low, Healing Touch for big hits."] = "練功期間在地城擔任治療的恢復配置。先點自然集中和強化治療之觸，20-22級點反射以在施法時回復法力，20多級點自然賜福和大地之母賜福，30多級點寧靜之魂和活化精神，39級前點強化回春術，然後40多級點平衡系的起源、自然威嚴和月光，50級點自然光采，51級點迅癒，53級點自然迅捷。最後幾點給強化憤怒和強化癒合。讓回春術持續在坦克身上，坦克血量變低時用癒合，大傷害時用治療之觸。"
L["Marksmanship: Solo Leveling"] = "射擊：單人練功"
L["Survival: Solo Leveling"] = "生存：單人練功"
L["Marksmanship: Dungeon Leveling"] = "射擊：地城練功"
L["Survival: Dungeon Leveling"] = "生存：地城練功"
L["Beast Mastery shooting with the pet tanking, the fastest way to level a Hunter in our model. Deadly Aspects first, Focused Fire, a point each in Improved Tracking and Lethal Attacks, Pathfinding at 19 (faster Aspect of the Cheetah between mobs), Unleashed Fury from 22 and Summon Hawk at 27. Then Ferocity, Bestial Discipline, the rest of Lethal Attacks and Efficiency by 42, since mana is what slows you down. Rapid Killing, Spirit Bond, Frenzy at 49, Improved Arcane Shot, Trueshot Aura at 57 and Improved Mend Pet close it out. Cast Summon Hawk whenever it's ready."] = "由寵物坦怪的野獸控制遠程射擊，在我們的模型中是獵人練功最快的方式。先點致命守護、專注之火，強化追蹤和致命攻擊各一點，19級點尋路（怪與怪之間更快的獵豹守護），22級起點狂怒釋放，27級點召喚獵鷹。然後是兇暴、野獸戒律，42級前點完致命攻擊並點效率，因為拖慢你的是法力。最後是急速殺戮、靈魂聯結、49級的狂亂、強化秘法射擊、57級的強擊光環和強化治療寵物。召喚獵鷹一冷卻好就施放。"
L["Marksmanship shooting with the pet tanking, about 5% slower than the Beast Mastery solo build in our model. Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim and Efficiency first, Rapid Killing and Trueshot Aura by 25, then Deadly Aspects, Focused Fire, Pathfinding and Unleashed Fury from Beast Mastery, with Summon Hawk at 41. Improved Stings, Hawk Eye and Rapid Recuperation come in the 40s, then Ferocity and Bestial Discipline, Barrage and Spirit Bond alternating from 54, and Ranged Weapon Specialization at 59-60."] = "由寵物坦怪的射擊系遠程配置，在我們的模型中比野獸控制單人配置慢約5%。先點致命攻擊、仔細瞄準和效率，25級前點急速殺戮和強擊光環，然後點野獸控制系的致命守護、專注之火、尋路和狂怒釋放，41級點召喚獵鷹。40多級點強化釘刺、鷹眼和急速回能，接著兇暴和野獸戒律，54級起交替點彈幕和靈魂聯結，59-60級點遠程武器專精。"
L["Survival shooting with the pet tanking: you stay at range rather than melee, about 10% slower than the Beast Mastery solo build in our model. Improved Tracking first, then Savage Strikes, Deflection and Clever Traps by 21, Deadly Aspects, Focused Fire and Pathfinding from Beast Mastery, and Surefooted, Endurance Training and Unleashed Fury in the 30s. Predator's Edge goes in one point every other level from 40 to 48, with Summon Hawk at 41 and Ferocity in between. Strider Kick at 50, then Bestial Discipline, Survivalist's Discipline, Spirit Bond, Resourcefulness and Lightning Reflexes."] = "由寵物坦怪的生存系遠程配置：你保持距離而不近戰，在我們的模型中比野獸控制單人配置慢約10%。先點強化追蹤，然後21級前點猛烈強擊、偏斜和靈巧陷阱，再點野獸控制系的致命守護、專注之火和尋路，30多級點穩固、耐久訓練和狂怒釋放。40到48級每隔一級點一點掠食者優勢，41級點召喚獵鷹，中間穿插兇暴。50級點陸行鳥腳踢，然後是野獸戒律、生存專家戒律、靈魂聯結、足智多謀和閃電反射。"
L["Beast Mastery shooting for dungeons while leveling. Deadly Aspects first, then Focused Fire and Pathfinding, Unleashed Fury from 20 and Summon Hawk at 25. Ferocity, Bestial Discipline, Intimidation at 34, Frenzy from 35 and Bestial Wrath at 40 finish the pet side. After that Marksmanship: Hawk Eye, Improved Concussive Shot, Efficiency and Careful Aim by 54, with Improved Revive Pet, Improved Mend Pet and Spirit Bond at the end. Let the tank hold the mobs: your pet attacks the tank's target, and Multi-Shot only once the tank has the pack."] = "練功期間打地城的野獸控制遠程射擊配置。先點致命守護，然後是專注之火和尋路，20級起點狂怒釋放，25級點召喚獵鷹。兇暴、野獸戒律、34級的脅迫、35級起的狂亂和40級的狂野怒火補完寵物方面。之後點射擊系：54級前點鷹眼、強化震盪射擊、效率和仔細瞄準，最後是強化復活寵物、強化治療寵物和靈魂聯結。讓坦克抓住怪物：你的寵物攻擊坦克的目標，坦克抓住整群怪後才用多重射擊。"
L["Marksmanship shooting for dungeons while leveling. Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim and Efficiency first, Trueshot Aura at 25 (it also helps other Hunters in the group), then Deadly Aspects, Focused Fire, Pathfinding and Unleashed Fury from Beast Mastery, with Summon Hawk at 41. Rapid Killing, Hawk Eye and Rapid Recuperation come in the 40s, then Ferocity, Barrage at 53 and Ranged Weapon Specialization from 56, with Spirit Bond and Improved Tracking as the last points."] = "練功期間打地城的射擊系遠程配置。先點致命攻擊、仔細瞄準和效率，25級點強擊光環（也能幫助隊伍中的其他獵人），然後點野獸控制系的致命守護、專注之火、尋路和狂怒釋放，41級點召喚獵鷹。40多級點急速殺戮、鷹眼和急速回能，接著兇暴，53級點彈幕，56級起點遠程武器專精，最後幾點給靈魂聯結和強化追蹤。"
L["Survival shooting for dungeons while leveling: you stay at range and shoot rather than fight in melee. Improved Tracking and Deadly Aspects fill the first ten levels, then Savage Strikes and Focused Fire at 20-23, Deflection, Surefooted and Endurance Training, and Unleashed Fury with Clever Traps in the 30s. Predator's Edge goes in one point every other level from 40 to 48, with Summon Hawk at 41 and Ferocity in between. Strider Kick at 50, then Bestial Discipline, Survivalist's Discipline, Resourcefulness, Lightning Reflexes and a point of Lethal Attacks at 60."] = "練功期間打地城的生存系遠程配置：你保持距離射擊，而不是近戰。前十級點強化追蹤和致命守護，然後20-23級點猛烈強擊和專注之火，接著偏斜、穩固和耐久訓練，30多級點狂怒釋放和靈巧陷阱。40到48級每隔一級點一點掠食者優勢，41級點召喚獵鷹，中間穿插兇暴。50級點陸行鳥腳踢，然後是野獸戒律、生存專家戒律、足智多謀、閃電反射，60級點一點致命攻擊。"
L["Arcane: Solo Leveling"] = "秘法：單人練功"
L["Fire: Solo Leveling"] = "火焰：單人練功"
L["Arcane: Dungeon Leveling"] = "秘法：地城練功"
L["Fire: Dungeon Leveling"] = "火焰：地城練功"
L["AoE grinding: pull packs of mobs, freeze them with Frost Nova, and Blizzard them down. Hard to learn, but the fastest way to level a Mage once you have it: about 30% less time than single-target Frost in our model. Improved Frostbolt, Elemental Precision, Ice Shards and Improved Frost Nova first, Ice Lance at 20, Piercing Ice, Improved Blizzard from 24, Frost Channeling, then Arcane Focus, Cold Snap, Arcane Concentration, Arcane Impact and Arcane Meditation for mana, Arctic Reach, Frostbite and Improved Cone of Cold. Grind single mobs with Frostbolt until your packs can be 4 or more; start with 3-4 mobs and add more as you learn."] = "範圍練功：拉一群怪，用冰霜新星凍住，再用暴風雪清掉。不好上手，但學會後是法師最快的練功方式：在我們的模型中比單體冰霜少花約30%時間。先點強化寒冰箭、元素準確、寒冰碎片和強化冰霜新星，20級點冰霜長矛，然後是刺骨寒冰，24級起點強化暴風雪，冰霜導能，接著點秘法集中、急速冷卻、秘法專注、秘法碰撞和秘法冥想補法力，最後是極寒延伸、霜寒刺骨和強化冰錐術。在你一次能拉4隻以上之前，先用寒冰箭單刷；從3-4隻開始，熟練後再逐步增加。"
L["Frost for leveling through dungeons. Elemental Precision, Improved Frostbolt and Ice Shards first, Ice Lance at 20, Frost Channeling, Piercing Ice and Shatter by 30, Improved Cone of Cold and Fingers of Frost in the early 30s, then Arcane Focus, Arcane Concentration, Arcane Impact and Arcane Meditation from Arcane. Frostbolt on bosses; once the tank holds a pack, Blizzard and Cone of Cold. Let the tank get the pack first: AoE pulls threat fast."] = "在地城中練功的冰霜配置。先點元素準確、強化寒冰箭和寒冰碎片，20級點冰霜長矛，30級前點冰霜導能、刺骨寒冰和碎冰，30級出頭點強化冰錐術和冰霜之指，然後點秘法系的秘法集中、秘法專注、秘法碰撞和秘法冥想。首領用寒冰箭；坦克穩住一群怪後，用暴風雪和冰錐術。先讓坦克拉住整群怪：範圍法術很快就會吸走仇恨。"
L["Arcane for leveling through dungeons. Arcane Focus and Arcane Concentration first, Elemental Precision, Improved Frostbolt and Ice Shards from Frost (Ice Shards for Blizzard and Cone of Cold crits), Arcane Blast at 30, Arcane Impact, Missile Barrage at 39, then Arcane Meditation, Arcane Mind and Arcane Instability. On bosses, two or three Arcane Blasts then Arcane Missiles; Blizzard on packs once the tank holds them. About 5% behind Frost in groups in our model."] = "在地城中練功的秘法配置。先點秘法集中和秘法專注，冰霜系的元素準確、強化寒冰箭和寒冰碎片（提高暴風雪和冰錐術的致命一擊），30級點秘法衝擊，秘法碰撞，39級點飛彈彈幕，然後點秘法冥想、秘法心智和秘法增效。首領先放兩三發秘法衝擊再接秘法飛彈；坦克穩住一群怪後用暴風雪。在我們的模型中，組隊時比冰霜落後約5%。"
L["Fire for leveling through dungeons. Improved Fireball, Elemental Precision and Wake of Fire first, Ignite by 23, Ice Shards from Frost for Blizzard crits, Pyroblast at 32, Arcane Focus and Arcane Concentration from Arcane, then Incineration and Master of Elements. Fireball on bosses, Fire Blast when it's ready; Blizzard on packs once the tank holds them. About 19% behind Frost in groups in our model."] = "在地城中練功的火焰配置。先點強化火球術、元素準確和火焰甦醒，23級前點點燃，冰霜系的寒冰碎片提高暴風雪的致命一擊，32級點炎爆術，秘法系的秘法集中和秘法專注，然後點焚化和元素大師。首領用火球術，火焰衝擊冷卻好就用；坦克穩住一群怪後用暴風雪。在我們的模型中，組隊時比冰霜落後約19%。"
L["Frost one mob at a time: Frostbolt, then Frost Nova when the mob reaches you and Ice Lance while it's frozen. Improved Frostbolt, Elemental Precision and Ice Shards first, Ice Lance at 21, Improved Frost Nova and Piercing Ice, Shatter at 26-28, then Fire Blast talents from Fire (Wake of Fire, Incineration, Ignite), Fingers of Frost at 42, Winter's Chill at 45, and Arcane Focus and Arcane Concentration from Arcane. The fastest single-target Mage build in our model."] = "冰霜一次打一隻怪：寒冰箭，怪物近身時用冰霜新星，凍住期間用冰霜長矛。先點強化寒冰箭、元素準確和寒冰碎片，21級點冰霜長矛，強化冰霜新星和刺骨寒冰，26-28級點碎冰，然後點火焰系強化火焰衝擊的天賦（火焰甦醒、焚化、點燃），42級點冰霜之指，45級點深冬之寒，以及秘法系的秘法集中和秘法專注。在我們的模型中是最快的單體法師配置。"
L["Arcane Missiles for questing alone, with one Arcane Blast before them from about 40. Arcane Focus and Arcane Concentration first, Improved Frostbolt and Elemental Precision from Frost, Arcane Blast at 29, Ice Lance at 31 and Arcane Impact, Missile Barrage at 36, Shatter in the early 40s for Frost Nova and Ice Lance when a mob reaches you, then Arcane Meditation, Arcane Mind, Arcane Instability and Presence of Mind at 59."] = "單人解任務用秘法飛彈，大約40級起先放一發秘法衝擊再接秘法飛彈。先點秘法集中和秘法專注，冰霜系的強化寒冰箭和元素準確，29級點秘法衝擊，31級點冰霜長矛，再點秘法碰撞，36級點飛彈彈幕，40級出頭點碎冰，怪物近身時用冰霜新星和冰霜長矛，然後點秘法冥想、秘法心智、秘法增效，59級點氣定神閒。"
L["Fireball for questing alone, opening each pull with Pyroblast from 20. Wake of Fire, Incineration and Ignite first, Pyroblast at 20, Elemental Precision and Improved Fireball, Master of Elements by 30, Heating Up at 32 (Fireball and Fire Blast crits shorten the next Pyroblast), Blast Wave at 33, Critical Mass and Fire Power by 42, Combustion at 43, then Arcane Focus, Arcane Concentration and Arcane Impact from Arcane. Fire Blast whenever it's ready."] = "單人解任務用火球術，20級起每次開怪都先放炎爆術。先點火焰甦醒、焚化和點燃，20級點炎爆術，元素準確和強化火球術，30級前點元素大師，32級點Heating Up（火球術和火焰衝擊的致命一擊會縮短下一發炎爆術），33級點衝擊波，42級前點火焰重擊和火焰強化，43級點燃燒，然後點秘法系的秘法集中、秘法專注和秘法碰撞。火焰衝擊冷卻好就用。"
L["AoE grinding: the fastest way to level a Mage in our model, but harder to play. Before 20 you kill single mobs with Frostbolt; from 20 you pull packs, freeze them with Frost Nova and Blizzard them down while Improved Blizzard slows them. Improved Frostbolt and Elemental Precision first, Frostbite at 18-21 for freezes, Improved Blizzard at 20, Frost Channeling and Permafrost in the 20s, Ice Shards, Improved Cone of Cold at 30-32, Cold Snap at 33, Ice Barrier at 40, then Arcane Focus, Arcane Concentration, Missile Barrage and Arcane Impact. Save Cold Snap for a second Frost Nova."] = "範圍練功：在我們的模型中是法師練功最快的方式，但較難操作。20級前逐隻用寒冰箭擊殺；20級起拉一群怪，用冰霜新星凍住它們，再用暴風雪打死，同時強化暴風雪讓它們減速。先點強化寒冰箭和元素準確，18-21級點霜寒刺骨以凍結目標，20級點強化暴風雪，20多級點冰霜導能和極寒冰霜，然後寒冰碎片，30-32級點強化冰錐術，33級點急速冷卻，40級點寒冰護體，再點秘法集中、秘法專注、飛彈彈幕和秘法碰撞。把急速冷卻留給第二次冰霜新星。"
L["Frost for leveling through dungeons. Elemental Precision and Improved Frostbolt first, Ice Shards from 17, Frost Channeling at 20-22, Ice Lance at 23, Shatter at 25-27, Improved Cone of Cold at 30-32 and Fingers of Frost at 33, then Arcane Focus, Arcane Concentration, Arcane Impact and Arcane Meditation from Arcane. In the 50s come Frostbite, two points of Improved Fire Blast and Winter's Chill at 55-59. Frostbolt on bosses; once the tank holds a pack, Blizzard and Cone of Cold. Let the tank get the pack first: AoE pulls threat fast."] = "在地城中練功的冰霜配置。先點元素準確和強化寒冰箭，17級起點寒冰碎片，20-22級點冰霜導能，23級點冰霜長矛，25-27級點碎冰，30-32級點強化冰錐術，33級點冰霜之指，然後點秘法系的秘法集中、秘法專注、秘法碰撞和秘法冥想。50多級點霜寒刺骨、兩點強化火焰衝擊，55-59級點深冬之寒。首領用寒冰箭；坦克穩住整群怪後用暴風雪和冰錐術。讓坦克先抓住整群怪：範圍法術很快就會拉走仇恨。"
L["Arcane for leveling through dungeons. Arcane Focus at 10-14 and Arcane Concentration at 15-19 first, Elemental Precision, Arcane Blast at 21, Missile Barrage, Arcane Impact and Arcane Meditation by 28, then Frost from 31: Improved Frostbolt, Ice Shards, Frost Channeling, Ice Lance at 41 and Shatter at 43-45. Presence of Mind at 49, Arcane Mind and Improved Cone of Cold in the 50s and Arcane Instability at 58-60. Improved Counterspell is a free pick on the way down. On bosses, four Arcane Blasts, then Arcane Missiles until the stacks run out; Blizzard on packs once the tank holds them."] = "在地城中練功的秘法配置。先在10-14級點秘法集中、15-19級點秘法專注，接著元素準確，21級點秘法衝擊，28級前點飛彈彈幕、秘法碰撞和秘法冥想，然後31級起點冰霜系：強化寒冰箭、寒冰碎片、冰霜導能，41級點冰霜長矛，43-45級點碎冰。49級點氣定神閒，50多級點秘法心智和強化冰錐術，58-60級點秘法增效。強化法術反制是一路上順便拿的免費點數。首領戰先用四次秘法衝擊，然後用秘法飛彈直到疊層用完；坦克穩住整群怪後用暴風雪。"
L["Fire for leveling through dungeons. Improved Fireball, Elemental Precision and Arcane Focus first, Incineration and Ignite from 20, Arcane Concentration in the 20s, Improved Fire Blast at 31, Ice Shards at 35-39 for Blizzard crits, Pyroblast at 40, Frost Channeling and Improved Flamestrike in the 40s, Ice Lance at 47 and Heating Up at 49, then Shatter and Master of Elements in the 50s and Arcane Impact at 57-59. Fireball on bosses with Fire Blast on cooldown, and Pyroblast at 3 Heating Up stacks once you have it; Blizzard on packs once the tank holds them."] = "在地城中練功的火焰配置。先點強化火球術、元素準確和秘法集中，20級起點焚化和點燃，20多級點秘法專注，31級點強化火焰衝擊，35-39級點寒冰碎片讓暴風雪更易致命一擊，40級點炎爆術，40多級點冰霜導能和強化烈焰風暴，47級點冰霜長矛，49級點提高熱量，然後50多級點碎冰和元素大師，57-59級點秘法碰撞。首領用火球術，冷卻好就用火焰衝擊，有了提高熱量後在3層時施放炎爆術；坦克穩住整群怪後用暴風雪。"
L["Frost for questing alone, single target only: Frostbolt and your wand, one or two mobs at a time, no AoE pulls. To pull packs, Frost: AoE Leveling is the fastest Mage build, about twice as fast in our model. Improved Frostbolt, Elemental Precision and Ice Shards first, Frostbite and Improved Frost Nova by 19, Ice Lance at 20, Frost Channeling, Shatter at 25-27, Incineration at 32-34, then Arcane Focus, Arcane Concentration, Missile Barrage, Arcane Impact, Arcane Blast, Arcane Wrath at 50 and Arcane Meditation. Ice Lance a mob while Frost Nova or Frostbite holds it."] = "單人解任務的冰霜配置，只打單體：寒冰箭和魔杖，一次一兩隻怪，不拉群範圍。想拉一群怪的話，冰霜：範圍練功是最快的法師配置，在我們的模型中約快一倍。先點強化寒冰箭、元素準確和寒冰碎片，19級前點霜寒刺骨和強化冰霜新星，20級點冰霜長矛，接著冰霜導能，25-27級點碎冰，32-34級點焚化，然後是秘法集中、秘法專注、飛彈彈幕、秘法碰撞、秘法衝擊，50級點秘法懲戒，再點秘法冥想。在冰霜新星或霜寒刺骨凍住怪物時對它用冰霜長矛。"
L["Arcane for questing alone, single target only: one or two mobs at a time, no AoE pulls. To pull packs, Frost: AoE Leveling is the fastest Mage build, about twice as fast in our model. Arcane Focus, Elemental Precision and Missile Barrage first, Arcane Concentration, Arcane Blast at 23, Arcane Impact at 25-27, Arcane Wrath at 28 and Arcane Meditation, then Frost from 32 (Improved Frost Nova, Ice Shards, Frost Channeling, Ice Lance at 42, Shatter at 44-46), Arcane Mind at 48-52 and Arcane Instability at 53-55. Use Arcane Wrath whenever it's ready, Arcane Blast windows, then Arcane Missiles."] = "單人解任務的秘法配置，只打單體：一次一兩隻怪，不拉群範圍。想拉一群怪的話，冰霜：範圍練功是最快的法師配置，在我們的模型中約快一倍。先點秘法集中、元素準確和飛彈彈幕，接著秘法專注，23級點秘法衝擊，25-27級點秘法碰撞，28級點秘法懲戒，再點秘法冥想，然後32級起點冰霜系（強化冰霜新星、寒冰碎片、冰霜導能，42級的冰霜長矛，44-46級的碎冰），48-52級點秘法心智，53-55級點秘法增效。秘法懲戒一好就用，接著是秘法衝擊的爆發時段，然後用秘法飛彈。"
L["Fireball for questing alone, with Fire Blast on cooldown and Pyroblast: open each pull with it from 23, and with Heating Up cast it again whenever you have 3 stacks (every Fire Blast adds one, crits add more). Improved Fireball, Elemental Precision, Incineration and Ignite first, Improved Fire Blast at 21, Pyroblast at 23, Heating Up at 28, then Frost talents for Frost Nova, Ice Lance and Shatter, Arcane Focus and Arcane Concentration, Missile Barrage, Arcane Impact, and Arcane Blast and Arcane Wrath (it requires Arcane Blast) from Arcane. Improved Flamestrike is a free point on the way to Heating Up."] = "單人解任務用火球術，火焰衝擊冷卻好就用，並搭配炎爆術：23級起每次開怪都先放炎爆術，有了Heating Up後，每疊到3層就再放一次（每發火焰衝擊疊一層，致命一擊疊更多）。先點強化火球術、元素準確、焚化和點燃，21級點Improved Fire Blast，23級點炎爆術，28級點Heating Up，然後點搭配冰霜新星、冰霜長矛和碎冰的冰霜系天賦，秘法集中和秘法專注，再點秘法系的飛彈彈幕、秘法碰撞，以及秘法衝擊和秘法懲戒（它需要秘法衝擊）。強化烈焰風暴是通往Heating Up途中的填充點數。"
L["Discipline: Solo Leveling"] = "戒律：單人練功"
L["Shadow for dungeons while leveling: Shadow Word: Pain on every mob in a pack, Devouring Plague and Mind Flay on the kill target, Mind Blast now and then (it makes a lot of threat). Shadow Focus and Wand Specialization first, Twin Disciplines at 17, Blackout at 18-22, Mind Flay at 23 with Improved Mind Flay, Spirit Tap and Shadow Weaving, Dark Inspiration and Improved Mind Blast, Darkness at 38-41, Vampiric Embrace at 42 (Shadowform requires it; it also heals your party), Shadowform at 43, then Devouring Contagion and Early Demise. Improved Renew and Twilight Focus are late filler."] = "練功期間打地城的暗影配置：對整群怪的每一隻上暗言術：痛，對擊殺目標用噬靈瘟疫和精神鞭笞，偶爾用心靈震爆（它會產生大量仇恨）。先點暗影集中和魔杖專精，17級點雙生戒律，18-22級點昏厥，23級點精神鞭笞並搭配強化精神鞭笞，接著精神分流和暗影之波、Dark Inspiration 和強化心靈震爆，38-41級點黑暗，42級點吸血鬼的擁抱（暗影形態需要它；它也會治療你的隊伍），43級點暗影形態，然後吞噬疫病和提早消亡。強化恢復和暮光集中是後期的填充點數。"
L["Discipline healing for dungeons while leveling. Twin Disciplines with a point of Improved Renew first, Mental Strength at 16-20, Meditation and Mental Agility, Holy Precision, Improved Power Word: Shield at 28-30, Penance at 31, Soul Warding at 32, Renewed Hope (it requires Soul Warding) and Divine Aegis by 40, Inner Focus at 42 and Power Infusion at 43. The rest goes to Shadow: Shadow Focus, Blackout and Spirit Tap, then Power in Light. Keep Renew on the tank, Power Word: Shield before big pulls, Penance and Heal for big hits."] = "練功期間打地城的戒律治療配置。先點雙生戒律和一點強化恢復，16-20級點心靈之力，接著冥想和精神敏銳、神聖精準，28-30級點強化真言術：盾，31級點懺悟，32級點靈魂結界，40級前點嶄新希望（它需要靈魂結界）和神禦之盾，42級點心靈專注，43級點注入能量。其餘點數給暗影系：暗影集中、昏厥和精神分流，然後是聖光之力。讓恢復持續在坦克身上，大規模拉怪前上真言術：盾，大傷害時用懺悟和治療術。"
L["Holy healing for dungeons while leveling, the stronger Priest healer in our model. Improved Renew, Holy Specialization and Divine Fury first, Improved Healing by 27, Binding Heal at 28, Litany of Light, Spiritual Guidance and Spiritual Healing in the 30s, Prayer of Mending at 40, then Discipline: Mental Strength, Meditation and Mental Agility. Keep Renew rolling on the tank, Heal and Greater Heal for big hits, Prayer of Mending on cooldown. Twilight Focus, Holy Reach and Power in Light are free picks."] = "在地城中練功的神聖治療配置，在我們的模型中是較強的牧師治療。先點強化恢復、神聖專精和神聖之怒，27級前點強化治療術，28級點束縛治療，30多級點聖光連禱、精神導引和精神治療，40級點癒合禱言，然後點戒律系的心靈之力、冥想和精神敏銳。坦克身上持續保持恢復，大傷害用治療術和強效治療術，癒合禱言冷卻好就用。暮光集中、神聖延伸和聖光之力可自由選擇。"
L["Level-60 open-world Shadow farming on packs of 4-5 mobs: Shadow Word: Pain on each, Devouring Plague (Devouring Contagion spreads it when a mob dies), Power Word: Shield and Psychic Scream, Vampiric Embrace to recover. About 240 mobs an hour in our model. Shadow Focus and Blackout first, Mind Flay at 20, Shadow Weaving, Vampiric Embrace at 29, Darkness, Shadowform at 40, then Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength, Meditation and Mental Agility, then a point each in Improved Psychic Scream and Improved Power Word: Shield. Chain fears and shields, and start with 3 mobs."] = "60級在野外以暗影刷4-5隻一群的怪：每隻上暗言術：痛，噬靈瘟疫（怪物死亡時吞噬疫病會把它擴散），真言術：盾和心靈尖嘯，用吸血鬼的擁抱回復。在我們的模型中每小時約240隻怪。先點暗影集中和昏厥，20級點精神鞭笞，接著暗影之波，29級點吸血鬼的擁抱，然後黑暗，40級點暗影形態，再點雙生戒律、心靈之力、冥想和精神敏銳，然後強化心靈尖嘯和強化真言術：盾各一點。連續使用恐懼和護盾，先從3隻怪開始。"
L["Shadow for questing alone: Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague and Mind Blast, then Mind Flay (the wand before you have it). Spirit Tap first (most of your mana comes back after each kill), Improved Shadow Word: Pain and Shadow Focus, Mind Flay at 20 with Improved Mind Flay, Shadow Weaving at 25-27, Dark Inspiration, Vampiric Embrace at 29 (Shadowform requires it), Devouring Contagion, Darkness at 35-39, Shadowform at 40 and Early Demise. From 43 you go into Discipline for mana: Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength, Meditation and Mental Agility, with a point of Improved Mind Blast at 60."] = "單人解任務的暗影配置：暗言術：痛、噬靈瘟疫和心靈震爆，然後精神鞭笞（學會之前用魔杖）。先點精神分流（大部分法力會在每次擊殺後回來），接著強化暗言術：痛和暗影集中，20級點精神鞭笞並搭配強化精神鞭笞，25-27級點暗影之波，接著 Dark Inspiration，29級點吸血鬼的擁抱（暗影形態需要它），然後吞噬疫病，35-39級點黑暗，40級點暗影形態，再點提早消亡。43級起點戒律系以補充法力：雙生戒律、心靈之力、冥想和精神敏銳，60級點一點強化心靈震爆。"
L["Shadow: Solo Leveling (No Shadowform)"] = "暗影：單人練功（無暗影形態）"
L["Shadow without Shadowform or Vampiric Embrace. Our current model, where damage over time can crit and you wand between spells, rates the Discipline mana talents above Shadowform while leveling: about 3% faster than Shadow: Solo Leveling and about as fast as Discipline. Spirit Tap first, Twin Disciplines at 15-19, Shadow Focus and Mental Strength in the 20s, Blackout, Mind Flay at 30, Meditation, Improved Mind Flay and Mental Agility in the 30s, Shadow Weaving at 40, Dark Inspiration at 46-50, Early Demise, Darkness at 53-57 and Power in Light at the end. Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague and Mind Blast, the wand between them."] = "不點暗影形態和吸血鬼的擁抱的暗影配置。在我們目前的模型中（持續傷害可以造成致命一擊，法術之間穿插魔杖攻擊），練功時戒律的法力天賦比暗影形態更好：比暗影：單人練功快約3%，速度與戒律相當。先點精神分流，15-19級點雙生戒律，20多級點暗影集中和心靈之力，昏厥，30級點精神鞭笞，30多級點冥想、強化精神鞭笞和精神敏銳，40級點暗影之波，46-50級點Dark Inspiration，提早消亡，53-57級點黑暗，最後點聖光之力。使用暗言術：痛、噬靈瘟疫和心靈震爆，其間穿插魔杖攻擊。"
L["(Experimental)"] = "（實驗性）"
L["|cffff8000Experimental:|r from our model only, not yet tried in game."] = "|cffff8000實驗性：|r僅來自我們的模型，尚未在遊戲中實測。"
L["Discipline for questing alone: Smite with Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague and Mind Blast, the wand when mana runs low. Wand Specialization and Spirit Tap first, Twin Disciplines and Shadow Focus through the teens, Improved Shadow Word: Pain at 21, Mental Strength and Meditation in the 20s, Improved Power Word: Shield at 30-32, Soul Warding at 33, Mental Agility, Blackout at 40, Improved Mind Blast at 41-44, Shadow Weaving and Vampiric Embrace in the late 40s, then Dark Inspiration, Devouring Contagion and Power in Light (Smite hits harder on a target with your Shadow Word: Pain) to 60."] = "單人解任務的戒律配置：懲擊搭配暗言術：痛、噬靈瘟疫和心靈震爆，法力不足時用魔杖。先點魔杖專精和精神分流，10多級點雙生戒律和暗影集中，21級點強化暗言術：痛，20多級點心靈之力和冥想，30-32級點強化真言術：盾，33級點靈魂結界，接著精神敏銳，40級點昏厥，41-44級點強化心靈震爆，40多級後段點暗影之波和吸血鬼的擁抱，然後到60級點 Dark Inspiration、吞噬疫病和聖光之力（懲擊對帶有你暗言術：痛的目標傷害更高）。"
L["Holy for questing alone: Smite with Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague and Mind Blast, the wand when mana runs low. Holy Specialization, Spirit Tap and Wand Specialization first, Shadow Focus and Improved Renew around 20, Twin Disciplines in the 20s, Divine Fury, Mental Strength and Meditation from 33 to 44, Holy Nova at 45, Mental Agility and Blessed Recovery, Blackout around 50, then Improved Healing late. Holy has few damage talents, so Improved Renew, Blessed Recovery and Improved Healing keep it your main tree and help when you heal a group."] = "單人解任務的神聖配置：懲擊搭配暗言術：痛、噬靈瘟疫和心靈震爆，法力不足時用魔杖。先點神聖專精、精神分流和魔杖專精，20級左右點暗影集中和強化恢復，20多級點雙生戒律，33到44級點神聖之怒、心靈之力和冥想，45級點神聖新星，接著精神敏銳和祝福復元，50級左右點昏厥，後期點強化治療術。神聖系的傷害天賦很少，所以強化恢復、祝福復元和強化治療術讓它保持為你的主天賦樹，也對你治療隊伍有幫助。"
L["Assassination: Solo Leveling"] = "刺殺：單人練功"
L["Subtlety: Solo Leveling"] = "敏銳：單人練功"
L["Assassination: Dungeon Leveling"] = "刺殺：地城練功"
L["Subtlety: Dungeon Leveling"] = "敏銳：地城練功"
L["Combat with daggers for dungeons while leveling, the strongest Rogue in groups in our model: Backstab from behind the mob, Eviscerate, Slice and Dice, Blade Flurry on packs. Improved Eviscerate, Lightning Reflexes and Puncturing Wounds first, Opportunity and Precision by 22, Malice, Murder and Ruthlessness in the 20s, Relentless Strikes, Dual Wield Specialization at 39, Blade Flurry at 43, Hack and Slash (more crit with daggers), Weapon Expertise, Aggression, Adrenaline Rush at 53, then Lethality and Cold Blood."] = "練功期間用於地城的匕首戰鬥配置，在我們的模型中是組隊時最強的盜賊：在怪物背後背刺、剔骨、切割，對付成群怪時用劍刃亂舞。先點強化剔骨、閃電反射和刺傷，22級前點伺機而動和精確，20多級點惡意、謀殺和無情，無情打擊，39級點雙武器專精，43級點劍刃亂舞，劈斬（匕首致命一擊更高）、武器專家、侵略，53級點能量刺激，然後點致命偷襲和冷血。"
L["Assassination with two daggers for dungeons while leveling: Backstab from behind, Mutilate from 32, Eviscerate and poisons. Malice and Opportunity first, Murder at 17-18, Remorseless Attacks, Improved Slice and Dice and Relentless Strikes in the early 20s, Ruthlessness, Cold Blood at 27, Vile Poisons at 28-30 and Mutilate at 32. Then Improved Eviscerate, Improved Sinister Strike, Precision and Puncturing Wounds, and Combat: Deflection and Riposte on the way to Flawless Execution at 48, Dual Wield Specialization, Blade Flurry at 53 for packs, then Hack and Slash and Improved Poisons."] = "練功期間打地城的雙匕首刺殺配置：從背後背刺，32級起用截肢，加上剔骨和毒藥。先點惡意和伺機而動，17-18級點謀殺，20級出頭點冷酷攻擊、強化切割和無情打擊，接著無情，27級點冷血，28-30級點惡性毒藥，32級點截肢。然後是強化剔骨、強化邪惡攻擊、精確和刺傷，以及戰鬥系：途中點偏斜和還擊，48級點完美處決，接著雙武器專精，53級點劍刃亂舞對付成群的怪，然後劈斬和強化毒藥。"
L["Subtlety with two daggers for dungeons while leveling: an Ambush opener, then Backstab from behind and Eviscerate. Opportunity and Malice first, Camouflage on the way to Improved Ambush at 18-20, Murder, Improved Sinister Strike, Lightning Reflexes and Puncturing Wounds through the 20s, then Setup, Precision and Initiative in the 30s, Master of Deception at 42, Serrated Blades, Premeditation at 46 and Improved Eviscerate. Then Flawless Execution at 51, Dual Wield Specialization and one point each in Heightened Senses, Hemorrhage, Blade Flurry, Ghostly Strike and Improved Slice and Dice."] = "練功期間打地城的雙匕首敏銳配置：伏擊起手，然後從背後背刺並用剔骨。先點伺機而動和惡意，途中點偽裝，18-20級點強化伏擊，20多級點謀殺、強化邪惡攻擊、閃電反射和刺傷，30多級點調整、精確和先發制人，42級點欺詐大師，接著鋸刃，46級點預謀，再點強化剔骨。然後51級點完美處決，接著雙武器專精，以及感官提升、出血、劍刃亂舞、鬼魅攻擊和強化切割各一點。"
L["Combat with two maces for questing alone, the fastest way to level a Rogue in our model: Sinister Strike and Eviscerate, Slice and Dice on longer fights. Improved Sinister Strike and Malice first, Lightning Reflexes at 14-16, Precision, Deflection and Riposte at 22, Endurance, the rest of Malice, Flawless Execution at 30, Murder and Ruthlessness, Relentless Strikes at 36, Dual Wield Specialization, Improved Eviscerate, Hack and Slash from 41, Blade Flurry at 45, Weapon Expertise, Aggression and Adrenaline Rush at 51, then Improved Slice and Dice, Lethality and Cold Blood at 58."] = "單人解任務的雙錘戰鬥配置，在我們的模型中是盜賊練功最快的方式：邪惡攻擊和剔骨，較長的戰鬥用切割。先點強化邪惡攻擊和惡意，14-16級點閃電反射，接著精確、偏斜，22級點還擊，然後耐久、惡意的剩餘點數，30級點完美處決，接著謀殺和無情，36級點無情打擊，然後雙武器專精、強化剔骨，41級起點劈斬，45級點劍刃亂舞，再點武器專家、侵略，51級點能量刺激，然後強化切割、致命偷襲，58級點冷血。"
L["Assassination with two swords for questing alone, about 4% slower than Combat in our model: Sinister Strike and Eviscerate, poisons on your blades. Malice and Improved Sinister Strike first, Murder at 17-18, Remorseless Attacks, Improved Slice and Dice and Relentless Strikes at 22, then Combat early: Lightning Reflexes, Precision, Deflection and Riposte at 31. Ruthlessness and Endurance in the 30s, Cold Blood at 39, Flawless Execution at 41, Dual Wield Specialization, Vile Poisons, Improved Eviscerate and Vigor, then Hack and Slash from 52 with Improved Poisons, and Seal Fate at 59."] = "單人解任務的雙劍刺殺配置，在我們的模型中比戰鬥慢約4%：邪惡攻擊和剔骨，武器上塗毒藥。先點惡意和強化邪惡攻擊，17-18級點謀殺，22級點冷酷攻擊、強化切割和無情打擊，然後提早點戰鬥系：閃電反射、精確、偏斜，31級點還擊。30多級點無情和耐久，39級點冷血，41級點完美處決，接著雙武器專精、惡性毒藥、強化剔骨和精力，然後52級起點劈斬並搭配強化毒藥，59級點封印命運。"
L["Subtlety with two daggers for questing alone, about 4% slower than Combat. Open every pull from stealth with Ambush, then Sinister Strike (Hemorrhage from 31), Ghostly Strike and Eviscerate. Opportunity and Malice first, Camouflage, Setup from 16, Improved Ambush at 17-19, Ghostly Strike at 21, Initiative at 23-25, Premeditation at 26, Serrated Blades and Hemorrhage at 31. Then Combat: Lightning Reflexes, Improved Eviscerate, Precision, Deflection and Riposte at 43, Endurance, Flawless Execution at 52, then Remorseless Attacks, Murder, Improved Slice and Dice and Relentless Strikes to finish."] = "單人解任務的雙匕首敏銳配置，比戰鬥慢約4%。每次開怪都從潛行中用伏擊起手，然後用邪惡攻擊（31級起改用出血）、鬼魅攻擊和剔骨。先點伺機而動和惡意，接著偽裝，16級起點調整，17-19級點強化伏擊，21級點鬼魅攻擊，23-25級點先發制人，26級點預謀，31級點鋸刃和出血。然後點戰鬥系：閃電反射、強化剔骨、精確、偏斜，43級點還擊，接著耐久，52級點完美處決，最後以冷酷攻擊、謀殺、強化切割和無情打擊收尾。"

