L["Shadow: PvP Leveling"] = "暗影：PvP練功"
L["Discipline: PvP Leveling"] = "戒律：PvP練功"
L["Arms with a two-hander for open-world PvP while leveling (36 Arms / 14 Protection / 1 Fury). Like the solo build early (Improved Rend, Deflection, Improved Overpower, Deep Wounds by 22), then Improved Heroic Strike, Improved Charge, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization at 25-27, Impale and Bloodthrill to 34, Improved Hamstring for sticking to targets, Sweeping Strikes at 39 and Mortal Strike at 40 to cut their healing. After 40 it goes into Protection to stay alive: Iron Will, Anticipation and Last Stand, then Weaponmaster, Improved Disarm and Cruelty last at 60."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的雙手武器武器系配置（武器36 / 防護14 / 狂怒1）。前期和單人配置相同（強化撕裂、偏斜、強化壓制，22級前點重傷），然後強化英勇打擊、強化衝鋒，25-27級點雙手武器專精，34級前點穿刺和鮮血快感，接著強化斷筋讓你黏住目標，39級點橫掃攻擊，40級點致死打擊降低對方受到的治療。40級後點防護系以求生存：鋼鐵意志、預知和破釜沉舟，然後武器大師、強化繳械，60級最後點殘忍。"
L["Dual-wield Fury for open-world PvP while leveling, with two one-handers. Cruelty and Improved Rend first, Unbridled Wrath by 22, Piercing Howl at 24 to slow runners, Blood Craze, Dual Wield Specialization from 28, Death Wish at 33, Improved Intercept at 34 and 37 to close gaps, Flurry from 38, Bloodthirst at 43, Enrage in the late 40s, then Gore Drinker, Lingering Rage and Booming Voice, with Deflection as the last point."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的雙持狂怒配置，使用兩把單手武器。先點殘忍和強化撕裂，22級前點怒不可遏，24級點刺耳怒吼讓逃跑者減速，接著血之狂熱，28級起點雙武器專精，33級點死亡之願，34級和37級點強化攔截以拉近距離，38級起點亂舞，43級點嗜血，40多級後段點狂怒，然後 Gore Drinker、Lingering Rage 和震耳嗓音，最後一點給偏斜。"
L["Shield Protection for open-world PvP while leveling, for players who want to be hard to kill rather than kill fast. Shield Specialization and Improved Revenge first, Anticipation, Last Stand at 21, Improved Disarm, Improved Shield Bash at 26-27 to silence casters, Concussion Blow at 31 for a stun, then Focused Rage, Improved Shield Wall, Bastion and Shield Slam at 41. After that the Fury tree: Cruelty, Booming Voice, Unbridled Wrath, Piercing Howl at 52 for a slow, Blood Craze and Enrage."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的盾牌防護配置，適合想要難以被殺死而非快速擊殺的玩家。先點盾牌專精和強化復仇，接著預知，21級點破釜沉舟，然後強化繳械，26-27級點強化盾擊讓施法者沉默，31級點震盪猛擊取得擊昏，然後集中怒氣、強化盾牆、堡壘，41級點盾牌猛擊。之後點狂怒天賦樹：殘忍、震耳嗓音、怒不可遏，52級點刺耳怒吼來減速，再點血之狂熱和狂怒。"
L["A two-hander Retribution build for open-world PvP while leveling, with a Holy dip for self-healing. Deflection first, Improved Judgement, Benediction and Seal of Command at 20 (its Judgement hits twice as hard on a target in Hammer of Justice), Pursuit of Justice and Sanctified Judgement, Eye for an Eye, Repentance at 30 for a free heal or a reset, then Divine Intellect, Spiritual Focus and Healing Light so your Holy Lights land, Voice of Truth at 41, Unyielding Faith, Divine Favor and Reverence. Experimental and model-based: a duel simulation against each class, not a combat log."] = "練功期間用於野外 PvP 的雙手武器懲戒配置，並投資少量神聖以自我治療。先點 偏斜，接著是 強化審判、祈福，20 級點 命令聖印（它的 審判 對受到 制裁之錘 影響的目標造成兩倍傷害）、正義追擊 與 聖化審判、以眼還眼，30 級點 懺悔 取得免費治療或重置，接著是讓你的 聖光術 順利施放的 神聖智慧、精神集中 與 治療之光，41 級點 真理之聲，再來是 不滅信仰、神恩術 與 崇敬。實驗性且以模型為基礎：是針對每個職業的決鬥模擬，不是戰鬥記錄。"
L["A Holy build for open-world PvP while leveling (27 Holy / 24 Retribution): you win the long fights on mana and heals. Divine Intellect, Spiritual Focus and Healing Light first, Reverence at 20-22, Voice of Truth, Improved Seals and Divine Favor by 25, then Benediction to 31 and Retribution for damage: Improved Judgement, Holy Conduit, Conviction, Seal of Command at 37, Pursuit of Justice, Unyielding Faith and Sanctified Judgement by 42, Eye for an Eye, then Holy Shock at 48, Vengeance, Repentance, Illumination and Holy Power late. Experimental and model-based: a duel simulation against each class, not a combat log."] = "練功期間用於野外 PvP 的神聖配置（神聖 27 / 懲戒 24）：靠法力與治療贏得長時間的戰鬥。先點 神聖智慧、精神集中 與 治療之光，20 至 22 級點 崇敬，25 級前點 真理之聲、強化聖印 與 神恩術，接著點 祈福 到 31 級，再點懲戒取得傷害：強化審判、神聖導體、定罪、37 級的 命令聖印、42 級前的 正義追擊、不滅信仰 與 聖化審判、以眼還眼，然後 48 級點 神聖震擊，後期再點 復仇、懺悔、啟發 與 聖能。實驗性且以模型為基礎：是針對每個職業的決鬥模擬，不是戰鬥記錄。"
L["Sword and board for open-world PvP while leveling: hard to kill, with stuns. Redoubt and Precision first, Guardian's Favor by 19 for a longer Blessing of Freedom and a shorter Blessing of Protection cooldown, Improved Righteous Fury and Sacred Duty, One-Handed Weapon Specialization, Improved Hammer of Justice and Templar's Bulwark at 30 (the biggest single gain), Shield Specialization, Iron Creed and Holy Shield at 40, then Deflection and Reckoning. Experimental and model-based: a duel simulation against each class, not a combat log; Protection is the weakest Paladin duel tree."] = "練功期間用於野外 PvP 的劍盾配置：難以擊殺，並帶有昏迷效果。先點 盾牌壁壘 與 精確，19 級前點 守護者的寵愛 以延長 自由祝福 並縮短 保護祝福 冷卻時間，接著是 強化正義之怒 與 神聖職務、單手武器專精，30 級點 強化裁決之錘 與 聖殿騎士之壁壘（單點收益最大），40 級點 盾牌專精、鐵之教條 與 神聖之盾，最後是 偏斜 與 清算。實驗性且以模型為基礎：是針對每個職業的決鬥模擬，不是戰鬥記錄；防護是聖騎士決鬥表現最弱的天賦樹。"
L["Shadow for open-world PvP while leveling (37 Shadow / 14 Holy): Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague and Mind Blast, then Mind Flay, with Blackout stuns, Psychic Scream, Silence and Vampiric Embrace healing you. Blackout at 10-14, Shadow Focus, Improved Psychic Scream at 20-21, Shadow Weaving, Mind Flay at 28, Vampiric Embrace at 29, Darkness at 35-39, Shadowform at 40, Twilight Focus (casts not pushed back while you are hit), Silence at 44, then Holy: Improved Renew, Holy Specialization, Spell Warding at 51-55 and Blessed Recovery. Improved Renew is just a gate for Spell Warding."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的暗影配置（暗影37 / 神聖14）：暗言術：痛、噬靈瘟疫和心靈震爆，然後精神鞭笞，加上昏厥擊昏、心靈尖嘯、沉默，以及治療你的吸血鬼的擁抱。10-14級點昏厥，接著暗影集中，20-21級點強化心靈尖嘯，然後暗影之波，28級點精神鞭笞，29級點吸血鬼的擁抱，35-39級點黑暗，40級點暗影形態，接著暮光集中（被擊中時施法不會延遲），44級點沉默，然後點神聖系：強化恢復、神聖專精，51-55級點法術護衛，再點祝福復元。強化恢復只是解鎖法術護衛的門檻。"
L["Discipline for open-world PvP while leveling (35 Discipline / 13 Holy / 3 Shadow): you win by damage (Smite, Mind Blast and damage over time spells), with Power Word: Shield, Flash Heal and Penance when you drop low. Wand Specialization, Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength and Meditation to 22, Improved Power Word: Shield, Mental Agility and Improved Inner Fire in the 20s, Penance at 30, Soul Warding at 33, Blackout at 34-35, Renewed Hope, Power Infusion at 42, then Holy Specialization, Spell Warding at 48-52 and Blessed Recovery, Divine Aegis from 53, then Improved Mana Burn and Shadow Focus."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的戒律配置（戒律35 / 神聖13 / 暗影3）：你靠傷害取勝（懲擊、心靈震爆和持續傷害法術），血量變低時用真言術：盾、快速治療和懺悟。22級前點魔杖專精、雙生戒律、心靈之力和冥想，20多級點強化真言術：盾、精神敏銳和強化心靈之火，30級點懺悟，33級點靈魂結界，34-35級點昏厥，接著嶄新希望，42級點注入能量，然後神聖專精，48-52級點法術護衛，再點祝福復元，53級起點神禦之盾，然後強化法力燃燒和暗影集中。"
L["Holy for open-world PvP while leveling (24 Holy / 23 Discipline / 4 Shadow): Smite and your damage over time spells, Flash Heal when you drop low, and talents that keep your casts going and mana up. Twilight Focus and Wand Specialization first, Holy Specialization, Improved Renew, Spell Warding, Twin Disciplines and Mental Strength through the 20s, Divine Fury, Blessed Recovery, Meditation and Mental Agility in the 30s, Improved Power Word: Shield, Improved Healing and Improved Inner Fire in the 40s, Soul Warding at 51 and Litany of Light. Inspiration, Shadow Focus and Blackout are filler."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的神聖配置（神聖24 / 戒律23 / 暗影4）：懲擊和持續傷害法術，血量變低時用快速治療，再加上讓你持續施法、維持法力的天賦。先點暮光集中和魔杖專精，到20多級為止點神聖專精、強化恢復、法術護衛、雙生戒律和心靈之力，30多級點神聖之怒、祝福復元、冥想和精神敏銳，40多級點強化真言術：盾、強化治療術和強化心靈之火，51級點靈魂結界，再點聖光連禱。靈感、暗影集中和昏厥是填充點數。"
L["Balance: PvP Leveling"] = "平衡：PvP練功"
L["Feral: PvP Leveling"] = "野性戰鬥：PvP練功"
L["Restoration: PvP Leveling"] = "恢復：PvP練功"
L["Enhancement: PvP Leveling"] = "增強：PvP練功"
L["Elemental: PvP Leveling"] = "元素：PvP練功"
L["Affliction: PvP Leveling"] = "痛苦：PvP練功"
L["Demonology: PvP Leveling"] = "惡魔學識：PvP練功"
L["Destruction: PvP Leveling"] = "毀滅：PvP練功"
L["Balance caster for open-world PvP while leveling (Balance 24 / Restoration 22 / Feral 5). Improved Wrath first, Genesis, Moonglow and Nature's Majesty in the teens, Improved Entangling Roots at 24-26 so roots hold longer on melee, Insect Swarm at 27 and Improved Starfire by 34 for its stun, with Nature's Focus mixed in so damage doesn't push back your casts. Then Naturalist at 36-40, Gift of the Earthmother, Gift of Nature, Reflection, Swiftmend at 47 and Nature's Swiftness at 51. Root melee, keep Moonfire and Insect Swarm up, cast Starfire, and heal yourself when you drop low."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的平衡施法配置（平衡24 / 恢復22 / 野性戰鬥5）。先點強化憤怒，10多級點起源、月光和自然威嚴，24-26級點強化糾纏根鬚，讓定身在近戰身上維持更久，27級點蟲群，34級前點強化星火術以取得它的擊昏效果，中間穿插自然集中，讓傷害不會延遲你的施法。然後36-40級點強化治療之觸，再點大地之母賜福、自然賜福、反射，47級點迅癒，51級點自然迅捷。定身近戰，保持月火術和蟲群，施放星火術，血量變低時治療自己。"
L["Feral for open-world PvP while leveling, played in Bear Form (Feral 26 / Restoration 25). Heart of the Wild first, Brutal Impact at 15-16 for a longer, more frequent Bash, Feral Swiftness, Thick Hide and Feral Charge at 20, Sharpened Claws and Savage Fury in the early 20s, Primal Bite at 25, Predatory Strikes, Nature's Focus so your heals aren't pushed back, and Leader of the Pack at 32. Then Furor, Naturalist and Restoration for self-healing (Gift of Nature, Reflection, Swiftmend at 50, Nature's Swiftness at 51). Charge and Bash, Maul and Primal Bite, and shift out to heal when you drop low."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的野性戰鬥配置，以熊形態進行（野性戰鬥26 / 恢復25）。先點野性之心，15-16級點野蠻衝撞讓重擊持續更久、更常可用，接著野性迅捷、厚皮，20級點野性衝鋒，20級出頭點鋒利獸爪和野蠻暴怒，25級點 Primal Bite，然後猛獸攻擊、自然集中（讓你的治療不被延遲），32級點獸群領袖。之後點激怒、強化治療之觸和恢復系的自我治療天賦（自然賜福、反射、50級的迅癒、51級的自然迅捷）。衝鋒並重擊，槌擊和 Primal Bite，血量變低時變身出來治療。"
L["Restoration for open-world PvP while leveling (Restoration 26 / Balance 24 / Feral 1). Nature's Focus first so your casts aren't pushed back, Naturalist at 15-19, Gift of the Earthmother at 20, Reflection and Gift of Nature in the 20s, Nature's Swiftness at 30. The 30s and 40s go to Balance: Genesis at 31-35, Nature's Majesty, Improved Moonfire, Nature's Reach, Improved Entangling Roots, Insect Swarm at 46 and Improved Starfire at 47-51, then Swiftmend at 52 and Improved Rejuvenation. Root melee, keep Moonfire and Insect Swarm up, cast Starfire or Wrath, and heal when you drop low."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的恢復配置（恢復26 / 平衡24 / 野性戰鬥1）。先點自然集中讓施法不被延遲，15-19級點強化治療之觸，20級點大地之母賜福，20多級點反射和自然賜福，30級點自然迅捷。30多級和40多級點平衡系：31-35級點起源，接著自然威嚴、強化月火術、自然延伸、強化糾纏根鬚，46級點蟲群，47-51級點強化星火術，然後52級點迅癒，再點強化回春術。定身近戰，保持月火術和蟲群，施放星火術或憤怒，血量變低時治療。"
L["Enhancement with a two-hander for open-world PvP while leveling: Rockbiter (Windfury from 30 if it hits harder), Flame Shock and Earth Shock (the interrupt), Stormstrike from 25, Lightning Shield, Stoneskin and Grounding Totems, and Healing Wave when you drop low. Ancestral Knowledge first for mana, Improved Lightning Shield, Mental Dexterity, Guardian Totems, Shamanistic Focus and Anticipation, Toughness, Spirit Weapons (parry), Improved Stormstrike, Elemental Weapons and Rage of the Farseer at 41. Then Restoration: Tidal Focus, Improved Healing Wave, Mindfulness and Mana Tide Totem at 56."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP、使用雙手武器的增強配置：石化武器（30級起若風怒武器打得更重就改用它）、烈焰震擊和大地震擊（打斷技），25級起用風暴打擊，閃電之盾、石甲圖騰和根基圖騰，血量變低時用治療波。先點先祖知識增加法力，接著強化閃電之盾、心靈迅敏、守護圖騰、薩滿之凝和預知，然後堅韌、魂化武器（招架）、強化風暴打擊、元素武器，41級點先知之怒。然後點恢復系：潮汐集中、強化治療波、正念，56級點法力之潮圖騰。"
L["Elemental for open-world PvP while leveling: Lightning Bolt and Flame Shock at range, Earth Shock to interrupt, Earthbind and Frost Shock to keep melee off you, Healing Wave when you're losing the race. Convection first, Call of Flame and Reverberation, Elemental Focus at 20, Elemental Warding, Concussion and Earthbound at 25 (Earthbind roots), then Trial by Fire, Eye of the Storm and Elemental Reach. From 32, Restoration: Improved Healing Wave, Tidal Focus, Improved Reincarnation, Mindfulness, Healing Focus, Mana Tide Totem at 48, Tidal Mastery, Nature's Swiftness at 53 and Healing Way."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的元素配置：在遠距離用閃電箭和烈焰震擊，用大地震擊打斷，用地縛圖騰和冰霜震擊讓近戰無法接近你，在拚不過對方時用治療波。先點傳導，接著烈焰召喚和迴響，20級點元素集中，然後元素結界、震盪，25級點大地之縛（讓地縛圖騰能定身），再點 Trial by Fire、暴風之眼和元素延伸。32級起點恢復系：強化治療波、潮汐集中、強化復生、正念、專注治療，48級點法力之潮圖騰，接著潮汐專精，53級點自然迅捷，再點治療之路。"
L["Restoration for open-world PvP while leveling: you outlast the opponent, healing yourself with Healing Wave, Healing Stream Totem and Nature's Swiftness while Flame Shock, Earth Shock, Lightning Bolt and Lightning Shield do the damage. Improved Healing Wave first, Mindfulness and Tidal Focus, Healing Focus, Improved Reincarnation, Mana Tide Totem at 25, Restorative Totems, Nature's Swiftness at 30, Healing Way, Purification and Riptide at 40. Then Elemental for damage: Convection at 41-45, Reverberation, Call of Flame, Elemental Focus, Elemental Warding and Earthbound at 56."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的恢復配置：你靠續航拖垮對手，用治療波、治療之泉圖騰和自然迅捷治療自己，同時由烈焰震擊、大地震擊、閃電箭和閃電之盾造成傷害。先點強化治療波，接著正念和潮汐集中、專注治療、強化復生，25級點法力之潮圖騰，然後恢復圖騰，30級點自然迅捷，接著治療之路、淨化，40級點激流。然後點元素系提高傷害：41-45級點傳導，再點迴響、烈焰召喚、元素集中、元素結界，56級點大地之縛。"
L["Affliction for open-world PvP while leveling, with the Succubus out. Improved Corruption at 10, Suppression, and Improved Drains at 15-17 for Drain Life, your filler that heals you for what it deals. Grim Reach at 18-19 lets you start from further away, then Improved Bane of Agony, Pandemic, Amplify Curse and Curse of Exhaustion at 24-25 to slow melee chasing you, Nightfall, Malevolence, Siphon Life at 30, Soul Siphon at 31-33 and Shadow Mastery at 35-39. The 40s and 50s add Destructive Reach, Fel Concentration and Demonology points. Keep the Succubus out and Seduce a melee attacker."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的痛苦配置，讓魅魔保持在場。10級點強化腐蝕術，接著鎮壓，15-17級點強化吸取以強化吸取生命，它是你的填補技能，造成多少傷害就治療你多少。18-19級點無情延伸讓你能從更遠處開打，然後強化痛苦災厄、災疫、詛咒增幅，24-25級點疲勞詛咒讓追擊你的近戰減速，接著夜幕、惡意，30級點生命虹吸，31-33級點靈魂虹吸，35-39級點暗影專精。40多級和50多級加上毀滅延伸、惡魔專注和惡魔學識系點數。讓魅魔保持在場，對近戰攻擊者使用誘惑。"
L["Deep Demonology for open-world PvP while leveling. Demonic Embrace, Unholy Power and Improved Sayaad come first, then Soul Link at 31, which sends 30% of the damage you take to your pet; take the point in Demonic Sacrifice it needs, but keep the pet out until Demonic Pact. Demonic Knowledge and Master Demonologist follow, then Demonic Pact at 41: sacrifice the Felhunter (health over time) or the Imp (more Shadow damage), which our model rates about the same, and summon the Succubus again. It assumes the Succubus from 20, with Seduction to stop a melee attacker. Drain Life is your filler."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的深度惡魔學識。先點惡魔之擁、邪惡強化和強化薩亞德，31級點靈魂鏈結，把你所受傷害的30%轉給寵物；補上它需要的惡魔犧牲點數，但在惡魔契印之前讓寵物保持在場。接著是惡魔知識和惡魔學識大師，41級點惡魔契印：犧牲地獄獵犬（持續恢復生命）或小鬼（更高暗影傷害），我們的模型認為兩者差不多，然後重新召喚魅魔。此配置假設從20級起使用魅魔，並以誘惑阻止近戰攻擊者。吸取生命是你的填補技能。"
L["Destruction for open-world PvP while leveling, built for burst, with the Succubus out. Bane and Destructive Reach first, Molten Skin at 16-20 for less damage taken, Shadowburn at 21 as an instant finisher, then Ruin, Aftermath and Conflagrate at 26 for a second burst. Suppression and Improved Drains in the low 30s make Drain Life your filler between Immolate and Conflagrate, healing you for what it deals. Then Agonizing Flames, Fire and Brimstone, Shadow and Flame, more Ruin and Bane, Bane of Havoc, Incinerate and Intensity against pushback. Keep the Succubus out and Seduce a melee attacker."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的毀滅配置，主打爆發，讓魅魔保持在場。先點災禍和毀滅延伸，16-20級點熔火之膚以減少受到的傷害，21級點暗影灼燒作為瞬發收尾技，然後毀滅、清算，26級點焚燒作為第二波爆發。30級出頭點鎮壓和強化吸取，讓吸取生命成為獻祭與焚燒之間的填補技能，造成多少傷害就治療你多少。然後是苦惱之焰、硫磺與火焰、暗影與火焰，更多毀滅和災禍，浩劫之禍、燒盡，以及對抗施法延遲的強烈。讓魅魔保持在場，對近戰攻擊者使用誘惑。"
L["Arcane: PvP Leveling"] = "秘法：PvP練功"
L["Fire: PvP Leveling"] = "火焰：PvP練功"
L["Frost: PvP Leveling"] = "冰霜：PvP練功"
L["Beast Mastery: PvP Leveling"] = "野獸控制：PvP練功"
L["Marksmanship: PvP Leveling"] = "射擊：PvP練功"
L["Survival: PvP Leveling"] = "生存：PvP練功"
L["Assassination: PvP Leveling"] = "刺殺：PvP練功"
L["Combat: PvP Leveling"] = "戰鬥：PvP練功"
L["Subtlety: PvP Leveling"] = "敏銳：PvP練功"
L["Arcane Blast into Arcane Missiles for open-world PvP while leveling, with Presence of Mind at 30 and Arcane Power at 40 for a burst opener. Improved Channeling first, Magic Absorption, Arcane Focus and Missile Barrage, Arcane Blast at 20, Arcane Impact, Arcane Wrath at 25, Improved Counterspell and Arcane Shielding, then Arcane Mind and Arcane Instability in the 30s. From 41 the points go to Frost: Elemental Precision, Improved Frostbolt, Permafrost, Ice Shards, Ice Lance at 51 and Shatter, with Incineration last. Open with Presence of Mind and Arcane Power before a melee class reaches you."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的秘法衝擊接秘法飛彈配置，30級點氣定神閒、40級點秘法強化，作為爆發起手。先點強化引導，接著魔法吸收、秘法集中和飛彈彈幕，20級點秘法衝擊，然後秘法碰撞，25級點秘法懲戒，再點強化法術反制和秘法屏護，30多級點秘法心智和秘法增效。41級起點數給冰霜系：元素準確、強化寒冰箭、極寒冰霜、寒冰碎片，51級點冰霜長矛，接著碎冰，最後點焚化。在近戰職業接近你之前，用氣定神閒和秘法強化起手。"
L["Fireball and Fire Blast for open-world PvP while leveling, opening with Pyroblast and Combustion. Improved Fireball, Impact and Improved Fire Blast first, Burning Soul at 20-22, Pyroblast at 24, Heating Up, Elemental Precision, Master of Elements and Incineration, Blast Wave at 31, Critical Mass and Fire Power, Combustion at 41, then the Frost tree late (Frost Warding, Improved Frostbolt, Permafrost, Ice Shards, Ice Lance at 51, Shatter at 56-58). Open with Pyroblast from range, then Blast Wave and Frost Nova when a melee class reaches you."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的火球術和火焰衝擊配置，以炎爆術和燃燒起手。先點強化火球術、衝擊和強化火焰衝擊，20-22級點燃燒之魂，24級點炎爆術，接著提高熱量、元素準確、元素大師和焚化，31級點衝擊波，然後火焰重擊和火焰強化，41級點燃燒，之後才點冰霜天賦樹（冰霜護罩、強化寒冰箭、極寒冰霜、寒冰碎片、51級的冰霜長矛、56-58級的碎冰）。從遠距離用炎爆術起手，近戰職業接近你時用衝擊波和冰霜新星。"
L["Frostbolt for open-world PvP while leveling: keep the target slowed, Frost Nova or a Frostbite freeze when a melee class reaches you, then step away and Ice Lance or Frostbolt while it is frozen. Improved Frostbolt first, Frostbite and Permafrost by 21, Ice Lance at 20, Elemental Precision, Shatter at 25-27, Ice Shards, Improved Cone of Cold and Winter's Chill in the 30s, Cold Snap at 39 (a second Frost Nova) and Ice Barrier at 40, then Arcane Focus, Magic Absorption, Arcane Resilience, Frost Channeling and Arcane Concentration late."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的寒冰箭配置：讓目標保持減速，近戰職業接近你時用冰霜新星或霜寒刺骨凍住它，然後退開，趁它被凍住時用冰霜長矛或寒冰箭。先點強化寒冰箭，21級前點霜寒刺骨和極寒冰霜，20級點冰霜長矛，接著元素準確，25-27級點碎冰，30多級點寒冰碎片、強化冰錐術和深冬之寒，39級點急速冷卻（第二次冰霜新星），40級點寒冰護體，後期點秘法集中、魔法吸收、秘法轉化、冰霜導能和秘法專注。"
L["Beast Mastery shooting for open-world PvP while leveling, with the pet doing a large share of the damage. Deadly Aspects and Focused Fire first, Improved Aspect of the Monkey at 17, Bestial Swiftness at 20, Unleashed Fury, Summon Hawk at 25, Ferocity from 26 and Intimidation at 30 for a stun. Then Spirit Bond and Survival's melee defense: Deflection, Survivalist from 38 and Deterrence at 43. Frenzy from 46 and Bestial Wrath at 51, then Improved Wing Clip, Hawk Eye (longer range to kite), Surefooted, Counterattack, Survival Tactics and a point of Lethal Attacks at 60."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的野獸控制遠程射擊，寵物負責很大一部分傷害。先點致命守護和專注之火，17級點強化靈猴守護，20級點野獸迅捷，接著狂怒釋放，25級點召喚獵鷹，26級起點兇暴，30級點脅迫取得擊昏。然後是靈魂聯結和生存系的近戰防禦：偏斜、38級起點生存技能專家、43級點威懾。46級起點狂亂，51級點狂野怒火，然後是強化摔絆、鷹眼（射程更遠，方便風箏）、穩固、反擊、求生戰術，60級點一點致命攻擊。"
L["Marksmanship shooting for open-world PvP while leveling. Improved Concussive Shot and Hawk Eye (longer range to kite) first, then Careful Aim, Deadly Aspects, Lethal Attacks, Improved Stings and Rapid Killing (shorter Rapid Fire), with Trueshot Aura at 29. Focused Fire, Improved Aspect of the Monkey, Pathfinding, Bestial Swiftness and Unleashed Fury in the 30s, Summon Hawk at 41, Efficiency, and Scatter Shot at 46 as a second way out of melee after Freezing Trap. Ferocity from 48 and Intimidation at 51 for a stun, then Barrage, Spirit Bond and a few single late points."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的射擊系遠程配置。先點強化震盪射擊和鷹眼（射程更遠，方便風箏），然後是仔細瞄準、致命守護、致命攻擊、強化釘刺和急速殺戮（縮短急速射擊冷卻），29級點強擊光環。30多級點專注之火、強化靈猴守護、尋路、野獸迅捷和狂怒釋放，41級點召喚獵鷹，接著效率，46級點驅散射擊，作為冰凍陷阱之外第二個脫離近戰的手段。48級起點兇暴，51級點脅迫取得擊昏，然後是彈幕、靈魂聯結和幾個後期的單點天賦。"
L["Survival as a ranged build for open-world PvP while leveling: you shoot and kite. Improved Tracking and a point of Improved Concussive Shot first, Survivalist at 16-20, Deterrence at 21 and Improved Wing Clip at 22, then Deadly Aspects, Clever Traps, Focused Fire and Surefooted. Predator's Edge at 34-37, then at 38 Survivalist's Discipline for shorter trap and Deterrence cooldowns, then Pathfinding, Unleashed Fury from 42 and Summon Hawk at 47 from Beast Mastery, Ferocity, Spirit Bond, Strider Kick at 55, Resourcefulness and Lightning Reflexes."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP、以遠程為主的生存配置：你一邊射擊一邊風箏。先點強化追蹤和一點強化震盪射擊，16-20級點生存技能專家，21級點威懾，22級點強化摔絆，然後是致命守護、靈巧陷阱、專注之火和穩固。34-37級點掠食者優勢，38級點生存專家戒律縮短陷阱和威懾的冷卻時間，接著尋路，42級起點狂怒釋放，47級點野獸控制系的召喚獵鷹，然後兇暴、靈魂聯結，55級點陸行鳥腳踢，再點足智多謀和閃電反射。"
L["Assassination with two swords for open-world PvP while leveling (26 Assassination / 25 Combat). Malice and Improved Sinister Strike first, Murder at 17-18, Lightning Reflexes, then Precision, Deflection and Improved Slice and Dice through the 20s, Relentless Strikes at 29, Endurance, Ruthlessness and Riposte at 33, Lethality and Cold Blood at 38, Flawless Execution at 41. Then Vile Poisons, Dual Wield Specialization, Improved Eviscerate, Improved Poisons, Improved Kidney Shot, Blade Flurry at 51, Vigor, Hack and Slash and Improved Gouge at 59. Open with Cheap Shot into Kidney Shot."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的雙劍刺殺配置（刺殺26 / 戰鬥25）。先點惡意和強化邪惡攻擊，17-18級點謀殺，接著閃電反射，然後20多級點精確、偏斜和強化切割，29級點無情打擊，接著耐久、無情，33級點還擊，38級點致命偷襲和冷血，41級點完美處決。然後是惡性毒藥、雙武器專精、強化剔骨、強化毒藥、強化腎擊，51級點劍刃亂舞，接著精力、劈斬，59級點強化鑿擊。以偷襲接腎擊起手。"
L["Combat with two swords for open-world PvP while leveling (32 Combat / 18 Assassination / 1 Subtlety). Improved Sinister Strike first, Lightning Reflexes at 12-14, Deflection, Precision, Endurance and Riposte at 21, Dual Wield Specialization at 26-29, Blade Flurry at 30, Hack and Slash from 31, Flawless Execution, Weapon Expertise, Aggression and Adrenaline Rush at 40. From 41 the points go to Assassination: Malice, Murder, Improved Slice and Dice, Ruthlessness, Relentless Strikes, Lethality and Cold Blood at 56. Open with Cheap Shot into Kidney Shot with Adrenaline Rush and Blade Flurry up."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的雙劍戰鬥配置（戰鬥32 / 刺殺18 / 敏銳1）。先點強化邪惡攻擊，12-14級點閃電反射，接著偏斜、精確、耐久，21級點還擊，26-29級點雙武器專精，30級點劍刃亂舞，31級起點劈斬，然後完美處決、武器專家、侵略，40級點能量刺激。41級起點數給刺殺系：惡意、謀殺、強化切割、無情、無情打擊、致命偷襲，56級點冷血。開啟能量刺激和劍刃亂舞，以偷襲接腎擊起手。"
L["Subtlety with two daggers for open-world PvP while leveling. Master of Deception at 10, Improved Sinister Strike, Opportunity, Lightning Reflexes and Setup, Deflection, Improved Ambush at 23-25, Ghostly Strike at 26, Precision, Endurance, Elusiveness at 32-34, Riposte at 35, Initiative and Premeditation at 38, Heightened Senses, Preparation at 43, then Dual Wield Specialization at 47-50 and Blade Flurry at 51. The last points go to Malice, Dirty Deeds, Serrated Blades, Hack and Slash and Flawless Execution. Open with Premeditation and Cheap Shot into Kidney Shot."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的雙匕首敏銳配置。10級點欺詐大師，接著強化邪惡攻擊、伺機而動、閃電反射和調整，然後偏斜，23-25級點強化伏擊，26級點鬼魅攻擊，接著精確、耐久，32-34級點飄忽不定，35級點還擊，38級點先發制人和預謀，然後感官提升，43級點伺機待發，接著47-50級點雙武器專精，51級點劍刃亂舞。最後幾點給惡意、陰險動作、鋸刃、劈斬和完美處決。以預謀和偷襲接腎擊起手。"
L["Level-60 farming: the Dire Maul East jump run (Pusillin, the Zevrim jump, Alzzin), about 3 runs an hour in our model. It levels as Balance: Improved Wrath first, Moonglow, Nature's Reach, Improved Moonfire and Nature's Majesty by 22, Vengeance at 25-27, Improved Starfire and Eclipse from 28 to 33, Insect Swarm at 34, Moonfury at 35-39, then Furor, Naturalist and Reflection from Restoration, Subtlety, Natural Shapeshifter and Moonkin Form at 60."] = "60級刷怪：厄運之槌東區跳躍路線（普希林、瑟雷姆跳躍、奧茲恩），在我們的模型中每小時約3趟。以平衡練功：先點強化憤怒，22級前點月光、自然延伸、強化月火術和自然威嚴，25-27級點復仇，28到33級點強化星火術和蝕星蔽月，34級點蟲群，35-39級點月怒，然後點恢復系的激怒、強化治療之觸和反射，再點微妙、自然變身，60級點梟獸形態。"
L["Level-60 farming: the Dire Maul East lasher packs (6 packs of 5), about 3.5 runs an hour in our model. It levels as Balance: Improved Wrath first, Moonglow, Nature's Reach, Improved Moonfire and Nature's Majesty by 22, Genesis, Vengeance at 25-29, Eclipse at 30, Nature's Grace at 31, Moonfury at 35-39, then Furor, Naturalist and Reflection from Restoration, Natural Shapeshifter at 53-55, Gift of Nature, and Moonkin Form at 58."] = "60級刷怪：厄運之槌東區的鞭笞者群（6群，每群5隻），在我們的模型中每小時約3.5趟。以平衡練功：先點強化憤怒，22級前點月光、自然延伸、強化月火術和自然威嚴，接著起源，25-29級點復仇，30級點蝕星蔽月，31級點自然之賜，35-39級點月怒，然後點恢復系的激怒、強化治療之觸和反射，53-55級點自然變身，再點自然賜福，58級點梟獸形態。"
L["Level-60 farming with Hurricane: gather packs of mobs and cast Hurricane on them, about 130 mobs an hour in our model. It levels as Balance: Improved Wrath first, Moonglow, Nature's Reach, Improved Moonfire, Nature's Majesty and Nature's Splendor by 23, Vengeance at 25-29, Eclipse at 30, Nature's Grace at 31, Genesis at 32-34, Moonfury at 35-39, then Nature's Focus, Naturalist and Reflection from Restoration, with Improved Starfire in the last points. No Moonkin Form in this build."] = "60級颶風刷怪：把成群的怪聚在一起並對它們施放颶風，在我們的模型中每小時約130隻怪。以平衡練功：先點強化憤怒，23級前點月光、自然延伸、強化月火術、自然威嚴和自然光采，25-29級點復仇，30級點蝕星蔽月，31級點自然之賜，32-34級點起源，35-39級點月怒，然後點恢復系的自然集中、強化治療之觸和反射，最後幾點給強化星火術。此配置不點梟獸形態。"
L["Level-60 farming: the Maraudon Princess run (three elite pairs, then Princess), about 4 runs an hour in our model. It levels as Balance: Improved Wrath first, Moonglow at 15-17, Improved Moonfire, Nature's Majesty and Nature's Splendor by 22, Genesis, Vengeance at 25-29, Eclipse at 30, Nature's Grace at 31, Improved Starfire at 32, Moonfury at 35-39, then Nature's Focus, Naturalist and Reflection from Restoration, more Improved Starfire at 53-56, Natural Shapeshifter and Moonkin Form at 58."] = "60級刷怪：瑪拉頓公主路線（三對精英怪，然後是公主），在我們的模型中每小時約4趟。以平衡練功：先點強化憤怒，15-17級點月光，22級前點強化月火術、自然威嚴和自然光采，接著起源，25-29級點復仇，30級點蝕星蔽月，31級點自然之賜，32級點強化星火術，35-39級點月怒，然後點恢復系的自然集中、強化治療之觸和反射，53-56級再點強化星火術，58級點自然變身和梟獸形態。"
L["Level-60 farming of the Dire Maul East jump run: Pusillin, the Zevrim jump and Alzzin, roughly 2.75 runs an hour in our model. Beast Mastery shooting with the pet, but it opens in Marksmanship: Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim, Rapid Killing and Improved Tracking by 24. Then Deadly Aspects, Focused Fire, Endurance Training and Unleashed Fury, Summon Hawk at 40, Ferocity and Bestial Discipline, Bestial Swiftness and Intimidation at 50-51, Frenzy, Bestial Wrath at 57 and Improved Stings last."] = "60級刷厄運之槌東區跳躍路線：普希林、瑟雷姆跳躍和奧茲恩，在我們的模型中每小時大約2.75趟。帶寵物的野獸控制遠程射擊，但開頭點射擊系：24級前點致命攻擊、仔細瞄準、急速殺戮和強化追蹤。然後是致命守護、專注之火、耐久訓練和狂怒釋放，40級點召喚獵鷹，接著兇暴和野獸戒律，50-51級點野獸迅捷和脅迫，然後狂亂，57級點狂野怒火，最後點強化釘刺。"
L["Level-60 farming of the Dire Maul North tribute run, about 5 runs an hour in our model. Marksmanship shooting with the pet: Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim and Efficiency first, Trueshot Aura at 25, then Deadly Aspects, Focused Fire, Endurance Training and Unleashed Fury from Beast Mastery, with Summon Hawk at 41 and Ferocity after it. The late levels go back to Marksmanship: Improved Stings, Mortal Shots at 49, Improved Arcane Shot, Ranged Weapon Specialization and Sniper Shot at 60."] = "60級刷厄運之槌北區貢品路線，在我們的模型中每小時約5趟。帶寵物的射擊系遠程配置：先點致命攻擊、仔細瞄準和效率，25級點強擊光環，然後點野獸控制系的致命守護、專注之火、耐久訓練和狂怒釋放，41級點召喚獵鷹，之後點兇暴。後期等級回到射擊系：強化釘刺，49級點致死射擊，接著強化秘法射擊、遠程武器專精，60級點狙擊。"
L["Level-60 farming of the Maraudon Princess run: three elite pairs and then Princess, about 4 runs an hour in our model. Beast Mastery shooting with the pet, but it opens in Marksmanship: Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim, Rapid Killing and Improved Tracking by 24. Then Deadly Aspects, Focused Fire, Pathfinding, Endurance Training and Unleashed Fury, Summon Hawk at 40, Ferocity and Bestial Discipline, Bestial Swiftness and Intimidation at 50-51, Frenzy, Bestial Wrath at 57 and Improved Stings last."] = "60級刷瑪拉頓公主路線：三對精英怪，然後是公主，在我們的模型中每小時約4趟。帶寵物的野獸控制遠程射擊，但開頭點射擊系：24級前點致命攻擊、仔細瞄準、急速殺戮和強化追蹤。然後是致命守護、專注之火、尋路、耐久訓練和狂怒釋放，40級點召喚獵鷹，接著兇暴和野獸戒律，50-51級點野獸迅捷和脅迫，然後狂亂，57級點狂野怒火，最後點強化釘刺。"
L["A level-60 Frost farm for the Dire Maul East jump run: Pusillin, the Zevrim jump and Alzzin, about 2 runs an hour in our model. Improved Frostbolt, Elemental Precision and Ice Shards first, Ice Lance at 20, Frost Channeling, Shatter, Frost Warding and Fingers of Frost, then Arcane Focus, Arcane Concentration, Arcane Subtlety, Arcane Impact and a point of Arcane Meditation from Arcane. Cold Snap, Arcane Shielding, Improved Cone of Cold and Winter's Chill fill the 50s, with Ice Barrier as the last point."] = "60級冰霜刷怪配置，用於厄運之槌東區跳躍路線：普希林、瑟雷姆跳躍和奧茲恩，在我們的模型中每小時約2趟。先點強化寒冰箭、元素準確和寒冰碎片，20級點冰霜長矛，接著冰霜導能、碎冰、冰霜護罩和冰霜之指，然後點秘法系的秘法集中、秘法專注、秘法精妙、秘法碰撞和一點秘法冥想。50多級點急速冷卻、秘法屏護、強化冰錐術和深冬之寒，最後一點給寒冰護體。"
L["A level-60 Frost farm for the Dire Maul East lasher packs (6 packs of 5), about 5 runs an hour in our model. Improved Frostbolt, Elemental Precision and Ice Shards first, Improved Blizzard at 20, Frost Channeling and Frost Warding, then Arcane Focus and Arcane Concentration, Ice Lance and Shatter around 40, Arcane Subtlety, Arcane Impact and Arcane Meditation. Fingers of Frost, Arctic Reach, Winter's Chill, Cold Snap and Ice Barrier finish the build in the 50s."] = "60級冰霜刷怪配置，用於厄運之槌東區的鞭笞者群（6群，每群5隻），在我們的模型中每小時約5趟。先點強化寒冰箭、元素準確和寒冰碎片，20級點強化暴風雪，接著冰霜導能和冰霜護罩，然後秘法集中和秘法專注，40級左右點冰霜長矛和碎冰，再點秘法精妙、秘法碰撞和秘法冥想。50多級以冰霜之指、極寒延伸、深冬之寒、急速冷卻和寒冰護體完成配置。"
L["Two-hander Retribution for leveling through dungeons. Benediction at 10, Deflection, Improved Judgement, Conviction and Seal of Command at 20, Vindication, Sacred Arbiter and Sanctified Judgement in the 20s, Vengeance at 30, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization and Champion of the Light by 37, then Holy: Divine Strength, Improved Seals, Healing Light, Purifying Power, Reverence, Infusion of Light, Illumination and Holy Shock at 58. Judgement of the Crusader on bosses, not trash; Seal of Command, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, Consecration once the tank holds the pack."] = "在地城中練功的雙手武器懲戒配置。10級點祈福，接著偏斜、強化審判、定罪，20級點命令聖印，20多級點辯護、神聖仲裁者和聖化審判，30級點復仇，37級前點雙手武器專精和光之勇士，然後點神聖系：神聖之力、強化聖印、治療之光、淨化能量、崇敬、聖光灌注、啟發，58級點神聖震擊。首領用十字軍審判，小怪不用；冷卻好就用命令聖印、審判和神聖打擊，坦克穩住整群怪後用奉獻。"
L["Holy for questing alone while staying ready to heal a group, about 11% slower than the fastest Paladin solo build. Divine Strength and Improved Seals first, Deflection to 21, then Benediction, Improved Judgement, Conviction, Healing Light, Reverence and Holy Conduit, Seal of Command at 31, Sanctified Judgement, Divine Intellect and Illumination by 45, Holy Shock at 46, then Benediction and Vengeance in the 50s. Play it like Retribution: Judgement of the Crusader to open, then Seal of Command; from 30 pull two mobs and add Consecration, and Holy Shock once you have it."] = "單人解任務的神聖配置，同時隨時能為隊伍治療，比最快的聖騎士單人配置慢約11%。先點神聖之力和強化聖印，21級前點偏斜，然後是祈福、強化審判、定罪、治療之光、崇敬和神聖導體，31級點命令聖印，45級前點聖化審判、神聖智慧和啟發，46級點神聖震擊，然後50多級點祈福和復仇。玩法和懲戒一樣：以十字軍審判開場，然後上命令聖印；30級起一次拉兩隻怪並加上奉獻，有了神聖震擊後也使用它。"
L["Level-60 AoE farming with a one-hander and shield (Prot 42 / Ret 9): gather 10-15 normal mobs, drop Consecration, keep Holy Shield up and let Retribution Aura do most of the killing, about 230 mobs an hour in our model. Redoubt, Precision and Toughness first, Improved Seal of Fury at 20 and Shield Specialization for mana, Templar's Bulwark at 30, Reckoning and Iron Creed, Holy Shield at 40, then Deflection, Holy Conduit and Improved Judgement from Retribution and Anticipation to finish. Spell power is your best stat by far."] = "60級使用單手武器和盾牌的範圍刷怪（防護42 / 懲戒9）：聚集10-15隻普通怪，放下奉獻，保持神聖之盾，讓懲戒光環負責大部分擊殺，在我們的模型中每小時約230隻怪。先點盾牌壁壘、精確和堅韌，20級點強化憤怒聖印，再點盾牌專精以回復法力，30級點聖殿騎士之壁壘，接著清算和鐵之教條，40級點神聖之盾，然後點懲戒系的偏斜、神聖導體和強化審判，最後以預知完成。法術能量是你最重要的屬性，遠超其他屬性。"
L["Level-60 farming: the Dire Maul East jump run (Pusillin, the Zevrim jump, then Alzzin), about 2.7 runs an hour in our model. Deflection first, then Improved Judgement, Conviction, Holy Conduit and Seal of Command at 20, Vindication, Sanctified Judgement and Sacred Arbiter, Vengeance at 30, Benediction and Champion of the Light by 37, then Holy from 38: Divine Strength, Improved Seals, Divine Intellect, Reverence, Healing Light, Illumination, Holy Shock at 58 and Divine Precision at 59."] = "60級刷怪：厄運之槌東區跳躍路線（普希林、瑟雷姆跳躍，然後是奧茲恩），在我們的模型中每小時約2.7趟。先點偏斜，然後強化審判、定罪、神聖導體，20級點命令聖印，接著辯護、聖化審判和神聖仲裁者，30級點復仇，37級前點祈福和光之勇士，38級起點神聖系：神聖之力、強化聖印、神聖智慧、崇敬、治療之光、啟發，58級點神聖震擊，59級點神性精準。"
L["Level-60 farming: the Dire Maul East lasher packs (6 packs of 5), about 3.8 runs an hour in our model. Deflection and Benediction first, Improved Judgement, Conviction and Seal of Command at 20, Sanctified Judgement, Vindication and Sacred Arbiter, Vengeance at 30, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization and Champion of the Light by 37, then Holy from 38: Divine Strength, Improved Seals, Divine Intellect, Reverence, Healing Light, Illumination, Holy Shock at 58 and Divine Precision at 59."] = "60級刷怪：厄運之槌東區的鞭笞者群（6群，每群5隻），在我們的模型中每小時約3.8趟。先點偏斜和祈福，接著強化審判、定罪，20級點命令聖印，然後聖化審判、辯護和神聖仲裁者，30級點復仇，37級前點雙手武器專精和光之勇士，38級起點神聖系：神聖之力、強化聖印、神聖智慧、崇敬、治療之光、啟發，58級點神聖震擊，59級點神性精準。"
L["Retribution for open-world PvP while leveling, with a Holy dip for self-healing and staying power. Deflection and Benediction first, Improved Judgement and Holy Conduit, Seal of Command at 20 (its Judgement hits twice as hard on a target in Hammer of Justice), Sanctified Judgement, Divine Intellect, Eye for an Eye, Pursuit of Justice and Repentance at 32, then Healing Light, Spiritual Focus, Voice of Truth at 41, Vengeance, Champion of the Light, Reverence and Unyielding Faith. Open with Hammer of Justice and a Judgement, heal behind Divine Protection or Divine Shield. Model-based."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的懲戒配置，點一些神聖系天賦提供自我治療和續航力。先點偏斜和祈福，接著強化審判和神聖導體，20級點命令聖印（目標處於制裁之錘效果下時，它的審判傷害加倍），然後聖化審判、神聖智慧、以眼還眼、正義追擊，32級點懺悔，再點治療之光、精神集中，41級點真理之聲，接著復仇、光之勇士、崇敬和不滅信仰。以制裁之錘和審判起手，在聖佑術或聖盾術保護下治療。依據模型推算。"
L["A Holy build for open-world PvP while leveling: you win the long fights on mana and heals. Divine Intellect, Spiritual Focus and Healing Light first, Reverence at 20-22, Unyielding Faith and Divine Favor by 25, Benediction to 30, then Retribution for damage (Improved Judgement, Conviction, Seal of Command at 36, Sanctified Judgement), Voice of Truth at 42, Illumination, Repentance at 51 and Vengeance in the 50s. Heal through Spiritual Focus and Voice of Truth when you're interrupted, stun with Hammer of Justice, keep Divine Shield for the moment you'd lose. Model-based."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的神聖配置：你靠法力和治療贏得長時間戰鬥。先點神聖智慧、精神集中和治療之光，20-22級點崇敬，25級前點不滅信仰和神恩術，30級前點完祈福，然後點懲戒系提高傷害（強化審判、定罪、36級的命令聖印、聖化審判），42級點真理之聲，接著啟發，51級點懺悔，50多級點復仇。被打斷時靠精神集中和真理之聲繼續治療，用制裁之錘擊昏，把聖盾術留到你快要輸的時刻。依據模型推算。"
L["Sword and board for open-world PvP while leveling: hard to kill, with long stuns. Toughness and Precision first, Guardian's Favor by 18 for a longer Blessing of Freedom and a shorter Blessing of Protection cooldown, Improved Righteous Fury and Sacred Duty, Improved Hammer of Justice and One-Handed Weapon Specialization by 29, Templar's Bulwark at 30, then Benediction, Holy Conduit and Conviction from Retribution, Eye for an Eye, Anticipation and Iron Creed, and Holy Shield late at 57. Model-based."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的單手盾配置：很難被殺死，並有長時間擊昏。先點堅韌和精確，18級前點守護者的寵愛，讓自由祝福持續更久、保護祝福冷卻更短，接著強化正義之怒和神聖職務，29級前點強化裁決之錘和單手武器專精，30級點聖殿騎士之壁壘，然後點懲戒系的祈福、神聖導體和定罪，再點以眼還眼、預知和鐵之教條，後期57級點神聖之盾。依據模型推算。"
L["Level-60 farming: the Dire Maul East jump run (Pusillin, the Zevrim jump, Alzzin), about 3.6 runs an hour in our model. Spirit Tap first, Improved Shadow Word: Pain, Improved Mind Blast at 16-20, Mind Flay at 22 with Improved Mind Flay, Shadow Weaving, Vampiric Embrace at 29 (Shadowform requires it), Devouring Contagion and Dark Inspiration, Darkness at 35-39 and Shadowform at 40, Early Demise, then Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength and Meditation from Discipline, with Improved Power Word: Shield and Soul Warding as the last points."] = "60級刷怪：厄運之槌東區跳躍路線（普希林、瑟雷姆跳躍、奧茲恩），在我們的模型中每小時約3.6趟。先點精神分流，接著強化暗言術：痛，16-20級點強化心靈震爆，22級點精神鞭笞並搭配強化精神鞭笞，然後暗影之波，29級點吸血鬼的擁抱（暗影形態需要它），接著吞噬疫病和 Dark Inspiration，35-39級點黑暗，40級點暗影形態，再點提早消亡，然後點戒律系的雙生戒律、心靈之力和冥想，最後幾點給強化真言術：盾和靈魂結界。"
L["Level-60 farming: the Maraudon Princess run (three elite pairs, then Princess), about 5 runs an hour in our model. Spirit Tap first, Improved Shadow Word: Pain, Improved Mind Blast at 16-20, Mind Flay at 22 with Improved Mind Flay, Shadow Weaving, Vampiric Embrace at 29 (Shadowform requires it), Devouring Contagion and Dark Inspiration, Darkness at 35-39 and Shadowform at 40, Early Demise, then Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength, Meditation and Mental Agility from Discipline, with a last point of Dark Inspiration and one in Blackout."] = "60級刷怪：瑪拉頓公主路線（三對精英怪，然後是公主），在我們的模型中每小時約5趟。先點精神分流，接著強化暗言術：痛，16-20級點強化心靈震爆，22級點精神鞭笞並搭配強化精神鞭笞，然後暗影之波，29級點吸血鬼的擁抱（暗影形態需要它），接著吞噬疫病和 Dark Inspiration，35-39級點黑暗，40級點暗影形態，再點提早消亡，然後點戒律系的雙生戒律、心靈之力、冥想和精神敏銳，最後一點給 Dark Inspiration，另一點給昏厥。"
L["Healing groups through dungeons while leveling. Tidal Focus, Mindfulness and Improved Healing Wave first, Water Shield at 20, Totemic Focus at 24, Mana Tide Totem at 25, then Tidal Mastery and Healing Way through the late 20s and early 30s. Restorative Totems (stronger Healing Stream and Mana Spring) starts at 34, Purification fills 35-39 and Riptide comes at 40. After that Ancestral Knowledge at 45-49, the rest of Totemic Focus, Nature's Swiftness at 54 and Natural Grace, with Convection and Thundering Strikes from the damage trees at the end."] = "練功期間在地城中為隊伍治療。先點潮汐集中、正念和強化治療波，20級點水之盾，24級點圖騰集中，25級點法力之潮圖騰，然後在20多級後段到30級出頭點潮汐專精和治療之路。恢復圖騰（強化治療之泉和法力之泉）從34級開始，35-39級點淨化，40級點激流。之後45-49級點先祖知識，點完圖騰集中，54級點自然迅捷，再點自然之擁，最後點傷害天賦樹的傳導和雷鳴猛擊。"
L["Elemental for dungeons while leveling: Fire Nova and Magma Totem on packs once the tank has them, Flame Shock, Earth Shock and Lightning Bolt on bosses. Convection, Call of Flame, Elemental Alacrity and Elemental Focus first, then Tidal Focus and Mindfulness from Restoration for mana, Concussion at 30-32 and Trial by Fire at 33-34. Thundering Strikes and Ancestral Knowledge fill 35-44, then Shamanistic Focus, Reverberation, Lightning Overload at 49-51 and Elemental Fury at 54-58. No Lava Burst in this build."] = "練功期間打地城的元素配置：坦克抓住成群的怪後用火焰新星和熔岩圖騰，首領用烈焰震擊、大地震擊和閃電箭。先點傳導、烈焰召喚、元素矯捷和元素集中，然後點恢復系的潮汐集中和正念補充法力，30-32級點震盪，33-34級點 Trial by Fire。35-44級點雷鳴猛擊和先祖知識，然後薩滿之凝、迴響，49-51級點閃電超載，54-58級點元素之怒。此配置不點熔岩爆發。"
L["Enhancement with a two-hander for questing alone, the fastest Shaman leveler in our model: Rockbiter Weapon, Flame Shock and Earth Shock, Stormstrike from 25, Healing Wave between pulls. Thundering Strikes and Mental Dexterity first, Improved Lightning Shield and Shamanistic Focus around 20, Elemental Weapons at 22-24, Flurry at 26-29, Improved Stormstrike and Mental Quickness, then Tidal Focus, Improved Healing Wave and Mindfulness from Restoration for mana. Convection and Call of Flame come at 41-48, then Totemic Focus, Water Shield and Maelstrom Weapon at 58-59."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器增強配置，在我們的模型中是最快的薩滿練功配置：石化武器、烈焰震擊和大地震擊，25級起用風暴打擊，開怪之間用治療波。先點雷鳴猛擊和心靈迅敏，20級左右點強化閃電之盾和薩滿之凝，22-24級點元素武器，26-29級點亂舞，接著強化風暴打擊和思想迅捷，然後點恢復系的潮汐集中、強化治療波和正念補充法力。41-48級點傳導和烈焰召喚，然後圖騰集中、水之盾，58-59級點氣漩武器。"
L["Elemental for questing alone: Flame Shock, Lightning Bolt and Earth Shock, a Searing Totem, and Fire Nova once the mob reaches you; Lava Burst on cooldown from 41. Convection, Call of Flame, Elemental Alacrity and Elemental Focus first, then Tidal Focus and Mindfulness for mana, Improved Reincarnation and Water Shield around 30. Concussion and Trial by Fire fill the 30s, Elemental Devastation and Lava Burst at 40-41, then Thundering Strikes, Guardian Totems, Lightning Overload at 49-51, Elemental Fury at 53-57 and Elemental Mastery at 58. About 34% slower than Enhancement solo in our model."] = "單人解任務的元素配置：烈焰震擊、閃電箭和大地震擊，放一個灼熱圖騰，怪物到你身邊後用火焰新星；41級起冷卻好就用熔岩爆發。先點傳導、烈焰召喚、元素矯捷和元素集中，然後潮汐集中和正念補充法力，30級左右點強化復生和水之盾。30多級點震盪和 Trial by Fire，40-41級點元素破壞和熔岩爆發，然後雷鳴猛擊、守護圖騰，49-51級點閃電超載，53-57級點元素之怒，58級點 Elemental Mastery。在我們的模型中比增強單人配置慢約34%。"
L["Restoration for questing alone, played like Elemental: Flame Shock, Lightning Bolt and Earth Shock, a Searing Totem and Fire Nova, Healing Wave between pulls. Tidal Focus and Mindfulness first, Improved Reincarnation, Water Shield at 20, then Elemental for damage: Convection at 21-25, Call of Flame, Elemental Alacrity and Elemental Focus. Totemic Focus fills the 30s, Elemental Devastation and Trial by Fire near 40, then Tidal Mastery, Restorative Totems, Healing Way, Lava Burst at 51, Lightning Overload and Nature's Swiftness at 56. About 40% slower than Enhancement solo in our model."] = "單人解任務的恢復配置，玩法像元素：烈焰震擊、閃電箭和大地震擊，放灼熱圖騰和火焰新星，開怪之間用治療波。先點潮汐集中和正念，接著強化復生，20級點水之盾，然後點元素系提高傷害：21-25級點傳導，再點烈焰召喚、元素矯捷和元素集中。30多級點圖騰集中，40級左右點元素破壞和 Trial by Fire，然後潮汐專精、恢復圖騰、治療之路，51級點熔岩爆發，接著閃電超載，56級點自然迅捷。在我們的模型中比增強單人配置慢約40%。"
L["Level-60 open-world pack farming as a shield tank: pull about 4 normal mobs, drop Magma Totem, Fire Nova on cooldown, Lightning Shield and Flame Shock, Rockbiter Weapon on your one-hander. Convection and Call of Flame first, Thundering Strikes and Mental Dexterity, Concussion and Elemental Focus, Elemental Warding at 31-33 and Trial by Fire at 34-35, then Improved Healing Wave, Mindfulness and Totemic Focus, with Guardian Totems, Anticipation, Water Shield, Toughness and Improved Reincarnation for survival. No Stormstrike. About 265 mobs an hour on level-57 mobs in our model."] = "60級以盾牌坦克在野外刷成群的怪：一次拉約4隻普通怪，放下熔岩圖騰，冷卻好就用火焰新星，加上閃電之盾和烈焰震擊，單手武器上用石化武器。先點傳導和烈焰召喚，接著雷鳴猛擊和心靈迅敏、震盪和元素集中，31-33級點元素結界，34-35級點 Trial by Fire，然後強化治療波、正念和圖騰集中，再以守護圖騰、預知、水之盾、堅韌和強化復生提高生存。不點風暴打擊。在我們的模型中，打57級的怪每小時約265隻。"
L["Level-60 farming: the Dire Maul East jump run (Pusillin, the Zevrim jump, then Alzzin), about 2 runs an hour in our model. On the way to 60 it takes Convection, Call of Flame, Elemental Alacrity and Elemental Focus first, Tidal Focus and Concussion, then Improved Healing Wave, Mindfulness, Improved Reincarnation and Water Shield at 36. Thundering Strikes comes at 37-41, then Ancestral Knowledge, Guardian Totems and Shamanistic Focus, with Mental Dexterity, Flurry at 53-56 and Mental Quickness at the end."] = "60級刷怪：厄運之槌東區跳躍路線（普希林、瑟雷姆跳躍，然後是奧茲恩），在我們的模型中每小時約2趟。練到60級的途中，先點傳導、烈焰召喚、元素矯捷和元素集中，接著潮汐集中和震盪，然後強化治療波、正念、強化復生，36級點水之盾。37-41級點雷鳴猛擊，然後先祖知識、守護圖騰和薩滿之凝，最後是心靈迅敏、53-56級的亂舞和思想迅捷。"
L["Demonology for questing alone, the fastest way to level a Warlock in our model: your demon tanks while you DoT and drain. Improved Health Funnel and Improved Corruption first, Suppression and Unholy Power alternating up to 21, Demonic Aegis and Demonic Embrace in the low 20s, Improved Sayaad at 26-28, Fel Vitality, Demonic Brand at 30-32 and Demonic Knowledge at 35-37. Then Affliction: Improved Drains at 38-40, Improved Life Tap, Improved Bane of Agony, Pandemic, Malevolence, Nightfall and Soul Siphon at 53-55, with Siphon Life, Improved Imp and Master Demonologist near the end."] = "單人解任務的惡魔學識配置，在我們的模型中是術士練功最快的方式：惡魔坦怪，你上持續傷害並吸取。先點強化生命通道和強化腐蝕術，到21級為止交替點鎮壓和邪惡強化，20級出頭點惡魔庇護和惡魔之擁，26-28級點強化薩亞德，接著惡魔活力，30-32級點惡魔烙印，35-37級點惡魔知識。然後點痛苦系：38-40級點強化吸取，接著強化生命分流、強化痛苦災厄、災疫、惡意、夜幕，53-55級點靈魂虹吸，接近尾聲時點生命虹吸、強化小鬼和惡魔學識大師。"
L["Destruction for questing alone while your demon tanks, about 16% slower than the Demonology solo build in our model. Bane at 10-15 with Improved Corruption at 11, Aftermath from 16, Suppression at 17-20, then Improved Life Tap, Unholy Power, Improved Drains at 29-31, Improved Health Funnel and Fel Vitality in the 30s. The 40s bring Improved Shadow Bolt, Improved Sayaad, Agonizing Flames and Improved Imp, then Demonic Brand, Intensity at 56-59 and a last point in Agonizing Flames."] = "單人解任務的毀滅配置，由惡魔坦怪，在我們的模型中比惡魔學識單人配置慢約16%。10-15級點災禍，11級點強化腐蝕術，16級起點清算，17-20級點鎮壓，然後強化生命分流、邪惡強化，29-31級點強化吸取，30多級點強化生命通道和惡魔活力。40多級點強化暗影箭、強化薩亞德、苦惱之焰和強化小鬼，然後惡魔烙印，56-59級點強烈，最後一點給苦惱之焰。"
L["Demonology for leveling through dungeons. Improved Imp at 10-13 with Improved Corruption at 11, Suppression and Unholy Power alternating up to 23, then the rest of Improved Corruption, Improved Health Funnel, Improved Sayaad and Improved Bane of Agony by 34. Demonic Embrace at 35-39, Demonic Aegis and Demonic Knowledge at 42-44 follow, then Improved Life Tap, Grim Reach, Nightfall, Malevolence and Siphon Life, with Improved Voidwalker, Master Demonologist and Pandemic as the last points."] = "在地城中練功的惡魔學識配置。10-13級點強化小鬼，11級點強化腐蝕術，到23級為止交替點鎮壓和邪惡強化，然後34級前點完強化腐蝕術，並點強化生命通道、強化薩亞德和強化痛苦災厄。接著35-39級點惡魔之擁，再點惡魔庇護和惡魔知識（42-44級），然後強化生命分流、無情延伸、夜幕、惡意和生命虹吸，最後幾點給強化虛空行者、惡魔學識大師和災疫。"
L["Destruction for leveling through dungeons. Bane at 10-18, with Improved Corruption at 11 and Suppression in between, Unholy Power at 20-24, then Improved Shadow Bolt at 25-33 alongside the rest of Improved Corruption. Ruin comes at 35-43 with Improved Bane of Agony and Pandemic, then Cataclysm, Nightfall, Aftermath and Malevolence through the 40s and 50s, Siphon Life, Shadowburn at 59 and Improved Health Funnel last."] = "在地城中練功的毀滅配置。10-18級點災禍，中間在11級點強化腐蝕術並穿插鎮壓，20-24級點邪惡強化，然後25-33級點強化暗影箭，同時點完強化腐蝕術。35-43級點毀滅，搭配強化痛苦災厄和災疫，然後40多級和50多級點災變、夜幕、清算和惡意，接著生命虹吸，59級點暗影灼燒，最後點強化生命通道。"
L["Level-60 farming: the Dire Maul East jump run (Pusillin, the Zevrim jump, then Alzzin), about 2.7 runs an hour in our model. The leveling points go to Improved Corruption, Bane at 11-15, Aftermath at 16-20, Unholy Power, Improved Life Tap, then Demonic Embrace and Demonic Aegis. Fel Vitality and Demonic Brand come in the late 30s, Demonic Sacrifice at 41, Decimation at 42 and Soul Link at 43, then Demonic Knowledge, Improved Shadow Bolt at 47-51, Agonizing Flames, Improved Felhunter at 55 and Master Demonologist at 56-60."] = "60級刷怪：厄運之槌東區跳躍路線（普希林、瑟雷姆跳躍，然後是奧茲恩），在我們的模型中每小時約2.7趟。練功點數給強化腐蝕術，11-15級點災禍，16-20級點清算，接著邪惡強化、強化生命分流，然後惡魔之擁和惡魔庇護。30多級後段點惡魔活力和惡魔烙印，41級點惡魔犧牲，42級點屠虐，43級點靈魂鏈結，然後惡魔知識，47-51級點強化暗影箭，接著苦惱之焰，55級點強化惡魔獵犬，56-60級點惡魔學識大師。"
L["Level-60 farming: the Maraudon Princess run (three elite pairs, then Princess), about 3.7 runs an hour in our model. Bane at 10-14 and Aftermath by 20 with Improved Corruption at 16, then Unholy Power, Improved Life Tap, Demonic Embrace and Demonic Aegis. Fel Vitality, Demonic Brand, Demonic Sacrifice at 39 and Master Summoner at 40, Decimation at 41-42 and Soul Link at 43, then Demonic Knowledge, Ruin at 47-51, Agonizing Flames, Improved Felhunter at 55 and Master Demonologist at 56-60."] = "60級刷怪：瑪拉頓公主路線（三對精英怪，然後是公主），在我們的模型中每小時約3.7趟。10-14級點災禍，20級前點清算，16級點強化腐蝕術，然後邪惡強化、強化生命分流、惡魔之擁和惡魔庇護。接著惡魔活力、惡魔烙印，39級點惡魔犧牲，40級點召喚大師，41-42級點屠虐，43級點靈魂鏈結，然後惡魔知識，47-51級點毀滅，接著苦惱之焰，55級點強化惡魔獵犬，56-60級點惡魔學識大師。"
L["Level-60 farming: two-hander Arms that pulls packs in the open world and AoEs them down with Sweeping Strikes, Whirlwind and Cleave, about 140 mobs an hour in our model. Improved Rend, Cruelty, Deflection and Improved Overpower first, Improved Tactical Mastery and Deep Wounds in the 20s, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization, Anger Management, Impale and Sweeping Strikes by 33, Bloodthrill and Weaponmaster in the 30s and early 40s, then the Fury tree: Unbridled Wrath, Blood Craze, Enrage and Death Wish at 60. It skips Mortal Strike for those Fury talents."] = "60級刷怪：雙手武器的武器系配置，在野外拉成群的怪，用橫掃攻擊、旋風斬和順劈斬範圍擊殺，在我們的模型中每小時約140隻怪。先點強化撕裂、殘忍、偏斜和強化壓制，20多級點強化戰術專精和重傷，33級前點雙手武器專精、憤怒掌控、穿刺和橫掃攻擊，30多級和40級出頭點鮮血快感和武器大師，然後點狂怒天賦樹：怒不可遏、血之狂熱、狂怒，60級點死亡之願。它為了這些狂怒天賦放棄致死打擊。"
L["Level-60 farming: Fury for the Dire Maul East lasher route, six packs of five lashers a run, about 4 runs an hour in our model. Improved Rend and Cruelty first, Deflection, Improved Overpower and Deep Wounds by 27, then Unbridled Wrath, Blood Craze, Lingering Rage and Enrage in the 30s, Death Wish at 43, Improved Execute, Flurry from 48, Bloodthirst at 53 and Gore Drinker, with Improved Charge and Two-Handed Weapon Specialization near the end."] = "60級刷怪：用於厄運之槌東區鞭笞者路線的狂怒配置，每趟六群、每群五隻鞭笞者，在我們的模型中每小時約4趟。先點強化撕裂和殘忍，27級前點偏斜、強化壓制和重傷，然後30多級點怒不可遏、血之狂熱、Lingering Rage 和狂怒，43級點死亡之願，接著強化斬殺，48級起點亂舞，53級點嗜血，再點 Gore Drinker，接近尾聲時點強化衝鋒和雙手武器專精。"
L["Level-60 farming: two-hander Arms for the Maraudon Princess run (three elite pairs, then Princess), a bit over 3 runs an hour in our model. Improved Rend, Cruelty, Deflection and Improved Overpower first, Improved Tactical Mastery and Deep Wounds in the 20s, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization, Anger Management, Impale and Sweeping Strikes by 33, Bloodthrill in the 30s, Weaponmaster from 40, Mortal Strike at 43, then Unbridled Wrath, Blood Craze and Enrage from the Fury tree."] = "60級刷怪：用於瑪拉頓公主路線（三對精英怪，然後是公主）的雙手武器武器系配置，在我們的模型中每小時略多於3趟。先點強化撕裂、殘忍、偏斜和強化壓制，20多級點強化戰術專精和重傷，33級前點雙手武器專精、憤怒掌控、穿刺和橫掃攻擊，30多級點鮮血快感，40級起點武器大師，43級點致死打擊，然後點狂怒天賦樹的怒不可遏、血之狂熱和狂怒。"
