L["Retribution: Dire Maul East Lasher Farming"] = "懲戒：厄運之槌東區鞭笞者刷怪"
L["Shadow: Dire Maul East Jump Run Farming"] = "暗影：厄運之槌東區跳躍路線刷怪"
L["Shadow: Maraudon Princess Farming"] = "暗影：瑪拉頓公主刷怪"
L["Elemental: Dungeon Leveling"] = "元素：地城練功"
L["Elemental: Solo Leveling"] = "元素：單人練功"
L["Retribution to Protection: Solo Leveling"] = "懲戒轉防護：單人練功"
L["Sword and board, pulling the most mobs you survive. Redoubt, Precision and Toughness first, Improved Seal of Fury at 20, Shield Specialization, One-Handed Weapon Specialization and Templar's Bulwark by 30, Reckoning by 36 and Holy Shield at 40, then Deflection, Improved Judgement, Conviction and Iron Creed. Seal of Fury, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, Consecration on packs, Holy Shield on cooldown, Hammer of Justice on one mob. Single pulls below 20, mostly two mobs in the 20s and 30s, three from 40. From 40 it's faster than Retribution; below 40 Retribution is (see Retribution to Protection). Model-based: the simulator doesn't cover this play style."] = "劍盾配置，在能活下來的前提下一次拉最多的怪。先點盾牌壁壘、精確和堅韌，20級點強化憤怒聖印，30級前點盾牌專精、單手武器專精和聖殿騎士之壁壘，36級前點清算，40級點神聖之盾，然後點偏斜、強化審判、定罪和鐵之教條。冷卻好就用憤怒聖印、審判和神聖打擊，成群的怪用奉獻，冷卻好就用神聖之盾，制裁之錘用在一隻怪上。20級前一次拉一隻，20多級和30多級大多拉兩隻，40級起拉三隻。40級起比懲戒更快；40級前懲戒更快（見懲戒轉防護）。基於模型：模擬器不涵蓋這種玩法。"
L["The fastest way to level a Paladin in our model, about 4% faster than staying Retribution: two-hander Retribution from 10 to 39, then Protection with a one-hander and shield from 40, where Holy Shield and multi-mob pulls take over. At 40 put the Protection build on your second talent spec (Forever unlocks it at 40, so no reset cost), or reset your talents at a trainer. Retribution part: as Retribution: Solo Leveling. Model-based."] = "在我們的模型中是聖騎士最快的練功方式，比一直維持懲戒快約4%：10到39級用雙手武器懲戒，40級起改用單手武器加盾牌的防護，由神聖之盾和一次拉多隻怪接手。40級時把防護配置放在你的第二套天賦專精上（Forever在40級開放，所以沒有重置費用），或到訓練師那裡重置天賦。懲戒部分：同懲戒：單人練功。基於模型。"
L["Two-hander Retribution for questing alone, the fastest of the single trees, about 4% behind Retribution to Protection (switch to Protection at 40). Deflection first, then Benediction, Improved Judgement and Conviction, Seal of Command at 20, Pursuit of Justice, Sanctified Judgement and Sacred Arbiter in the 20s, Vengeance at 30, Champion of the Light by 37 and Twist of Light at 40 for its cheaper seals, then Divine Strength, Improved Seals and Reverence from Holy. Open on Judgement of the Crusader, then Seal of Command, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, and Hammer of Justice before a Judgement of Command (it doubles on a stunned target). From 30 pull two mobs and add Consecration."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器懲戒配置，是單一天賦樹中最快的，比懲戒轉防護（40級轉防護）慢約4%。先點偏斜，接著點祈福、強化審判和定罪，20級點命令聖印，20多級點正義追擊、聖化審判和神聖仲裁者，30級點復仇，37級前點光之勇士，40級點聖光折射讓聖印更便宜，然後點神聖系的神聖之力、強化聖印和崇敬。先用十字軍審判開怪，然後冷卻好就用命令聖印、審判和神聖打擊，並在命令審判前先用制裁之錘（對被擊暈的目標傷害加倍）。30級起一次拉兩隻怪並加上奉獻。"
L["Affliction with Shadow Bolt: Malevolence, Nightfall, Pandemic, Shadow Mastery, Improved Corruption and Siphon Life, with Improved Shadow Bolt, Bane and Ruin. Same build at Tier 1."] = "以暗影箭為主的痛苦：惡意、夜幕、災疫、暗影專精、強化腐蝕術和生命虹吸，再加上強化暗影箭、災禍和毀滅。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Arcane talents, Fire spells: Arcane Concentration, Arcane Meditation, Arcane Focus and Missile Barrage, with Ignite, Critical Mass, Master of Elements and Fire Power. You nuke with Fireball (Arcane Missiles is too weak on these talents), so gear for Fire damage. Same build at Tier 1."] = "秘法天賦、火焰法術：秘法專注、秘法冥想、秘法集中和飛彈彈幕，再加上點燃、火焰重擊、元素大師和火焰強化。用火球術輸出（這套天賦下秘法飛彈太弱），所以裝備以火焰傷害為主。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Arms with a two-hander: Mortal Strike, Improved Tactical Mastery, Weaponmaster and Two-Handed Weapon Specialization, plus Cruelty and Unbridled Wrath from Fury. Tier 1 moves a point from Improved Execute to Spearing Strike."] = "使用雙手武器的武器戰：致死打擊、強化戰術專精、武器大師和雙手武器專精，再加上狂怒系的殘忍和怒不可遏。T1階段把強化斬殺的1點移到穿刺打擊。"
L["Assassination: Mutilate (Raid)"] = "刺殺：截肢（團隊）"
L["Bear raid tank: Thick Hide, Natural Reaction, Feral Instinct, Leader of the Pack, Rend and Tear and Primal Bite, with Ferocity, Heart of the Wild and Genesis. Armor counts for a lot (Dire Bear Form multiplies it). Tier 1 moves Berserk's point to Shredding Attacks."] = "熊團隊坦克：厚皮、自然反應、野性本能、獸群領袖、碎裂撕扯和 Primal Bite，再加上兇暴、野性之心和起源。護甲值非常重要（巨熊形態會讓它成倍提高）。T1階段把狂暴的點數移到撕碎攻擊。"
L["Beast Mastery (34 / 17 Marksmanship): Summon Hawk, Bestial Wrath, Frenzy, Ferocity and Unleashed Fury, with Lethal Attacks, Efficiency, Careful Aim and Trueshot Aura. The best Hunter raid build in the simulator, shooting from range with Summon Hawk on cooldown. Same build at Tier 1."] = "野獸控制（34 / 射擊17）：召喚獵鷹、狂野怒火、狂亂、兇暴和狂怒釋放，再加上致命攻擊、效率、仔細瞄準和強擊光環。模擬器中最強的獵人團隊配置，在遠程射擊，召喚獵鷹一冷卻好就用。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Cat: Shredding Attacks, Predatory Strikes, Blood Frenzy, Leader of the Pack, Rend and Tear and Berserk, with Genesis and Nature's Focus from Balance and Restoration. Same build at Tier 1."] = "獵豹：撕碎攻擊、猛獸攻擊、血之狂暴、獸群領袖、碎裂撕扯和狂暴，再加上平衡和恢復系的起源與自然集中。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Combat with daggers: Dual Wield Specialization, Aggression, Opportunity, Blade Flurry and Adrenaline Rush, with Malice, Lethality, Improved Slice and Dice and Cold Blood. The strongest Rogue raid build in the simulator. Tier 1 moves Cold Blood's point to Lethality."] = "匕首戰鬥：雙武器專精、侵略、伺機而動、劍刃亂舞和能量刺激，再加上惡意、致命偷襲、強化切割和冷血。模擬器中最強的盜賊團隊配置。T1階段把冷血的點數移到致命偷襲。"
L["Combat with swords: Hack and Slash, Weapon Expertise, Aggression, Blade Flurry and Adrenaline Rush, with Malice, Ruthlessness, Relentless Strikes and Lethality from Assassination. Same build at Tier 1."] = "用劍的戰鬥：劈斬、武器專家、侵略、劍刃亂舞和能量刺激，再加上刺殺系的惡意、無情、無情打擊和致命偷襲。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Combat: Daggers (Raid)"] = "戰鬥：匕首（團隊）"
L["Demonic Pact: Master Demonologist, Demonic Pact, Soul Link and Demonic Brand, with Improved Shadow Bolt, Bane and Ruin. Sacrifice your demon before the pull for Demonic Pact. The strongest Warlock raid build in the simulator. Same build at Tier 1."] = "惡魔契印：惡魔學識大師、惡魔契印、靈魂鏈結和惡魔烙印，再加上強化暗影箭、災禍和毀滅。開怪前犧牲你的惡魔來取得惡魔契印。模擬器中最強的術士團隊配置。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Destruction with the Imp out: Improved Shadow Bolt, Bane, Ruin, Improved Imp and Agonizing Flames, with Malevolence, Pandemic and Nightfall from Affliction. No Demonic Sacrifice: keeping the Imp is ahead in the simulator. Tier 1 moves a point from Fel Vitality to Unholy Power."] = "放出小鬼的毀滅：強化暗影箭、災禍、毀滅、強化小鬼和苦惱之焰，再加上痛苦系的惡意、災疫和夜幕。不點惡魔犧牲：模擬器中保留小鬼更強。T1階段把惡魔活力的1點移到邪惡強化。"
L["Discipline raid healer: Penance, Divine Aegis, Renewed Hope, Power Infusion and Improved Power Word: Shield, with Holy Specialization, Divine Fury and Inspiration from Holy. Same build at Tier 1."] = "戒律團隊治療者：懺悟、神禦之盾、嶄新希望、注入能量和強化真言術：盾，再加上神聖系的神聖專精、神聖之怒和靈感。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Elemental: Lava Burst, Lightning Overload, Elemental Fury, Elemental Mastery and Concussion, with Tidal Focus, Ancestral Knowledge and Thundering Strikes. Elemental runs short on mana, so Intellect and Mp5 matter. Same build at Tier 1."] = "元素：熔岩爆發、閃電超載、元素之怒、元素精通和震盪，再加上潮汐集中、先祖知識和雷鳴猛擊。元素容易缺法力，所以智力和每5秒回魔很重要。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Enhancement: Stormstrike, Flurry, Maelstrom Weapon, Elemental Weapons and Improved Stormstrike, with Thundering Strikes, Ancestral Knowledge, Water Shield and Mana Tide Totem. Same build at Tier 1."] = "增強：風暴打擊、亂舞、氣漩武器、元素武器和強化風暴打擊，再加上雷鳴猛擊、先祖知識、水之盾和法力之潮圖騰。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Fireball: Improved Fireball, Ignite, Critical Mass, Master of Elements, Improved Scorch and Pyroblast, with Arcane Focus and Arcane Subtlety. The strongest Mage raid build in the simulator. Same build at Tier 1."] = "火球術：強化火球術、點燃、火焰重擊、元素大師、強化灼燒和炎爆術，再加上秘法集中和秘法精妙。模擬器中最強的法師團隊配置。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Frost: Improved Frostbolt, Ice Shards, Winter's Chill, Shatter, Fingers of Frost and Ice Lance, with Arcane Focus, Arcane Concentration and Missile Barrage from Arcane. Tier 1 moves a point from Arcane Focus to Arcane Impact."] = "冰霜：強化寒冰箭、寒冰碎片、深冬之寒、碎冰、冰霜之指和冰霜長矛，再加上秘法系的秘法集中、秘法專注和飛彈彈幕。T1階段把秘法集中的1點移到秘法碰撞。"
L["Fury with a two-hander: Bloodthirst, Flurry, Death Wish and Enrage, with Two-Handed Weapon Specialization, Deep Wounds and Impale from Arms. About as strong as Arms: take it if your best weapon is a two-hander."] = "使用雙手武器的狂怒：嗜血、亂舞、死亡之願和狂怒，再加上武器系的雙手武器專精、重傷和穿刺。強度和武器差不多：如果你最好的武器是雙手武器就選它。"
L["Fury with two one-handers: Bloodthirst, Flurry, Dual Wield Specialization, Death Wish and Furious Precision, with Improved Tactical Mastery, Deep Wounds and Impale from Arms. The strongest Warrior raid build in the simulator. Tier 1 moves a point from Enrage to Improved Bloodrage."] = "雙持單手武器的狂怒：嗜血、亂舞、雙武器專精、死亡之願和狂暴精確，再加上武器系的強化戰術專精、重傷和穿刺。模擬器中最強的戰士團隊配置。T1階段把狂怒的1點移到強化血性狂暴。"
L["Fury: Dual Wield (Raid)"] = "狂怒：雙持（團隊）"
L["Fury: Two-Hander (Raid)"] = "狂怒：雙手武器（團隊）"
L["Holy raid healer: Illumination, Holy Power, Healing Light, Divine Favor and Holy Shock, with Benediction, Improved Judgement and Conviction from Retribution. Same build at Tier 1."] = "神聖團隊治療者：啟發、神聖之力、治療之光、神恩術和神聖震擊，再加上懲戒系的祈福、強化審判和定罪。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Holy raid healer: Spiritual Guidance, Spiritual Healing, Holy Specialization, Inspiration, Improved Healing and Prayer of Mending, with Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength and Meditation from Discipline. Same build at Tier 1."] = "神聖團隊治療者：精神導引、精神治療、神聖專精、靈感、強化治療術和癒合禱言，再加上戒律系的雙生戒律、心靈之力和冥想。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Moonkin: Moonkin Form, Moonfury, Vengeance, Improved Starfire, Nature's Grace and Insect Swarm, with Heart of the Wild, Nature's Focus and Reflection from Restoration. Downrank to save mana. Same build at Tier 1."] = "梟獸：梟獸形態、月怒、復仇、強化星火術、自然之賜和蟲群，再加上恢復系的野性之心、自然集中和反射。用低等級法術節省法力。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Mortal Shots, Barrage, Ranged Weapon Specialization, Careful Aim and Trueshot Aura, with Unleashed Fury, Ferocity and Summon Hawk from Beast Mastery. About 10% behind Beast Mastery. Tier 1 moves a point from Bestial Discipline to Ranged Weapon Specialization."] = "致死射擊、彈幕、遠程武器專精、仔細瞄準和強擊光環，再加上野獸控制系的狂怒釋放、兇暴和召喚獵鷹。比野獸控制落後約10%。T1階段把野獸戒律的1點移到遠程武器專精。"
L["Mutilate with daggers: Seal Fate, Cold Blood, Vile Poisons, Improved Poisons and Lethality, with Precision, Dual Wield Specialization and Lightning Reflexes from Combat. Tier 1 moves a point each from Seal Fate and Murder to Improved Slice and Dice and Opportunity."] = "匕首截肢：封印命運、冷血、惡性毒藥、強化毒藥和致命偷襲，再加上戰鬥系的精確、雙武器專精和閃電反射。T1階段從封印命運和謀殺各移1點到強化切割和伺機而動。"
L["Protection raid tank: Shield Specialization, Anticipation, Bastion, Defiance, Improved Sunder Armor and Shield Slam, with Deflection and Cruelty from Arms and Fury. Same build at Tier 1."] = "防護團隊坦克：盾牌專精、預知、堡壘、挑釁、強化破甲攻擊和盾牌猛擊，再加上武器和狂怒系的偏斜與殘忍。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Recommended raid tank. Redoubt, Anticipation, Reckoning and Holy Shield, with Deflection, Conviction and Vindication from Retribution (Vindication lowers the boss's attack power) and Iron Creed and Holy Conduit for mana on long fights. Tier 1 moves a point from Holy Conduit to Shield Specialization."] = "推薦的團隊坦克。盾牌壁壘、預知、清算和神聖之盾，再加上懲戒系的偏斜、定罪和辯護（辯護會降低首領的攻擊強度），以及在長時間戰鬥中補法力的鐵之教條和神聖導體。T1階段把神聖導體的1點移到盾牌專精。"
L["Restoration raid healer: Riptide, Tidal Mastery, Healing Way, Restorative Totems, Purification and Mana Tide Totem, with Thundering Strikes and Ancestral Knowledge from Enhancement. Same build at Tier 1."] = "恢復團隊治療者：激流、潮汐專精、治療之路、恢復圖騰、淨化和法力之潮圖騰，再加上增強系的雷鳴猛擊和先祖知識。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Restoration raid healer: Wild Growth, Swiftmend, Nature's Swiftness, Gift of Nature, Improved Regrowth and Living Spirit, with Genesis, Moonglow and Heart of the Wild from Balance. Same build at Tier 1."] = "恢復團隊治療者：野性痊癒、迅癒、自然迅捷、自然賜福、強化癒合和活化精神，再加上平衡系的起源、月光和野性之心。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Ret dip for Deflection and Holy Conduit, with Iron Creed, Benediction and Reckoning: cheaper seals, Judgements and Consecration for long fights."] = "淺點懲戒取得偏斜和神聖導體，再加上鐵之教條、祈福和清算：長時間戰鬥中聖印、審判和奉獻更省法力。"
L["Seal twisting with Twist of Light: Seal of Command, Sanctified Judgement, Vengeance and Two-Handed Weapon Specialization, with Divine Strength, Divine Intellect and Benediction. Twisting costs a lot of mana, so Intellect and Mp5 count for more than Strength. Same build at Tier 1."] = "搭配聖光折射的扭聖印：命令聖印、聖化審判、復仇和雙手武器專精，再加上神聖之力、神聖智慧和祈福。扭聖印很耗法力，所以智力和每5秒回魔比力量更重要。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Shadowform: Shadow Weaving, Darkness, Shadow Focus, Improved Mind Blast and Vampiric Embrace, with Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength and Inner Focus from Discipline. Tier 1 moves Early Demise's point to Mental Agility."] = "暗影形態：暗影之波、黑暗、暗影集中、強化心靈震爆和吸血鬼的擁抱，再加上戒律系的雙生戒律、心靈之力和心靈專注。T1階段把提早消亡的點數移到精神敏銳。"
L["Survival shooting from range: Lightning Reflexes, Surefooted, Predator's Edge and Expose Prey, with Lethal Attacks, Efficiency, Careful Aim, Mortal Shots and Trueshot Aura. About 20% behind Beast Mastery. Tier 1 moves a point from Resourcefulness to Predator's Edge."] = "在遠程射擊的生存：閃電反射、穩固、掠食者優勢和暴露獵物，再加上致命攻擊、效率、仔細瞄準、致死射擊和強擊光環。比野獸控制落後約20%。T1階段把足智多謀的1點移到掠食者優勢。"
L["Survival: Melee Weave (Raid)"] = "生存：近戰穿插（團隊）"
L["Theorycraft, not a recommendation: Survival that steps into melee between Auto Shots for Raptor Strike, Mongoose Bite and Strider Kick, then back out to 12 yards. Played perfectly in the simulator it beats Beast Mastery by about 15%, but every lost Auto Shot or late step eats that lead, and on a plain ranged rotation these talents are the weakest Hunter build."] = "理論值配置，不推薦：生存獵人在自動射擊之間走進近戰使用猛禽一擊、貓鼬撕咬和陸行鳥腳踢，再退回12碼外。在模擬器中完美操作時比野獸控制強約15%，但每少一次自動射擊或晚一步移動都會吃掉這份領先；若只用一般遠程循環，這套天賦是最弱的獵人配置。"
L["Theorycraft"] = "理論值"
L["|cffc29bffTheorycraft:|r strong only with perfect play in the simulator; not a recommendation."] = "|cffc29bff理論值：|r只有在模擬器中完美操作時才強，並非推薦配置。"
